(337008, 25656, 7033, '<td valign="top">hmmm. country life? you''re pushin'' it. Very good macro shot excellent detail. Only -8 because I don''t think it fits the challenge head on.</td>', 'hmmm. country life? you''re pushin'' it. Very good macro shot excellent detail. Only -8 because I don''t think it fits the challenge head on.', '2003-06-25 01:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
