(337364, 26118, 8522, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture, my only 10 this challenge. Great green, the overall saturation is spot-on.  The composition is good, even the angle of the wings is perfect. Nice one! 10</td>', 'Beautiful picture, my only 10 this challenge. Great green, the overall saturation is spot-on.  The composition is good, even the angle of the wings is perfect. Nice one! 10', '2003-06-25 06:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(337365, 26273, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot... the drop of water makes all the difference here. The lighting on the barbed wire is great, I like your composition. Shame about the pinkish blob on the right. 9</td>', 'Interesting shot... the drop of water makes all the difference here. The lighting on the barbed wire is great, I like your composition. Shame about the pinkish blob on the right. 9', '2003-06-25 06:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(337366, 25647, 8522, '<td valign="top">I like this photo, it''s not every day you see a kid with a homemade bike! Duotone works very well here. I like his expression, and the way that the person pulling is facing away, the combination enhances the fleeting quality of the capture. 9</td>', 'I like this photo, it''s not every day you see a kid with a homemade bike! Duotone works very well here. I like his expression, and the way that the person pulling is facing away, the combination enhances the fleeting quality of the capture. 9', '2003-06-25 06:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(337367, 25978, 8522, '<td valign="top">IR has worked very well for you here, the quality is stunning! I love the textures, especially of the tree which is razor sharp. There''s something about the placement of the stones that bothers me though, maybe I''d have prefered them not to be touching the tree in your photo. 9</td>', 'IR has worked very well for you here, the quality is stunning! I love the textures, especially of the tree which is razor sharp. There''s something about the placement of the stones that bothers me though, maybe I''d have prefered them not to be touching the tree in your photo. 9', '2003-06-25 06:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(337370, 26265, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I''d have prefered this perhaps a touch sharper. The composition is stunning, I love how their gaze leads your eye towards the empty foreground on the right. The sky is very atmospheric. This might have got a 10 without that border, which I REALLY dislike. Your photo would have been far more effective with a different one. 9</td>', 'Great shot, I''d have prefered this perhaps a touch sharper. The composition is stunning, I love how their gaze leads your eye towards the empty foreground on the right. The sky is very atmospheric. This might have got a 10 without that border, which I REALLY dislike. Your photo would have been far more effective with a different one. 9', '2003-06-25 06:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(337372, 26163, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great colours and (presumably) manipulation of hues and saturations. I love the composition and use of contrasts, the white of the tree works very well with the tractor. Effective textures, everything is very sharp. My only minor gripe is that possibly the composition feels a little too one-sided and unbalanced... especially with the curve that leads your eye to the tractor.  9</td>', 'Great colours and (presumably) manipulation of hues and saturations. I love the composition and use of contrasts, the white of the tree works very well with the tractor. Effective textures, everything is very sharp. My only minor gripe is that possibly the composition feels a little too one-sided and unbalanced... especially with the curve that leads your eye to the tractor.  9', '2003-06-25 06:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(337374, 26315, 8522, '<td valign="top">A striking shot, but your greens are way over-saturated. It''s on the mountains where this really detracts. It also feels a little underexposed. 6</td>', 'A striking shot, but your greens are way over-saturated. It''s on the mountains where this really detracts. It also feels a little underexposed. 6', '2003-06-25 06:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(337375, 26132, 8522, '<td valign="top">WHY, WHY, WHY??? What a beautiful photo, but why so small? It''s hard to make anything out at that size. 6</td>', 'WHY, WHY, WHY??? What a beautiful photo, but why so small? It''s hard to make anything out at that size. 6', '2003-06-25 06:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(337376, 25688, 8522, '<td valign="top">A wonderful portrait, your model is very photogenic. The colours in the costume are lovely. The overall saturation is great. Skin tones are nice and delicate. However, it doesn''t really say ''country life'' to me. 5</td>', 'A wonderful portrait, your model is very photogenic. The colours in the costume are lovely. The overall saturation is great. Skin tones are nice and delicate. However, it doesn''t really say ''country life'' to me. 5', '2003-06-25 06:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(337377, 25494, 8522, '<td valign="top">An interesting character shot, but why didn''t you straighten the horizon? It looks awful! Shame also that his face is in shadow. Great expression and pipe though! 5</td>', 'An interesting character shot, but why didn''t you straighten the horizon? It looks awful! Shame also that his face is in shadow. Great expression and pipe though! 5', '2003-06-25 06:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(337379, 26198, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I love those eyes. I would have scored more here without that huge transparent border which really spoils this for me. 8</td>', 'Great shot, I love those eyes. I would have scored more here without that huge transparent border which really spoils this for me. 8', '2003-06-25 06:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(337381, 26270, 8522, '<td valign="top">Love this shot, the tongue and nose are great. Not sure about the crop... maybe I''d have included the top of the ears, or removed them altogether.  The patches of green in the backround are distracting, I think they try to give a wild or jungle feel, but this doesn''t work here. 8</td>', 'Love this shot, the tongue and nose are great. Not sure about the crop... maybe I''d have included the top of the ears, or removed them altogether.  The patches of green in the backround are distracting, I think they try to give a wild or jungle feel, but this doesn''t work here. 8', '2003-06-25 06:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(337382, 26118, 8297, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2003-06-25 06:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(337384, 25648, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great capture, but needs some better cropping IMO. There''s too much sky, and I think the sun should not be centred. Great silhouette though, and sumptous colours. 7</td>', 'Great capture, but needs some better cropping IMO. There''s too much sky, and I think the sun should not be centred. Great silhouette though, and sumptous colours. 7', '2003-06-25 06:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(337386, 26001, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great shot, beautiful colours, nice composition. Shame that the foreground trees aren''t sharper. I don''t like the rainbow flare effect from the sun. Is that a filter? 7</td>', 'Great shot, beautiful colours, nice composition. Shame that the foreground trees aren''t sharper. I don''t like the rainbow flare effect from the sun. Is that a filter? 7', '2003-06-25 06:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
