(337409, 26293, 5728, '<td valign="top">I couldn''t think of giving this photo less than 10. It is fantastic!!! Good work.</td>', 'I couldn''t think of giving this photo less than 10. It is fantastic!!! Good work.', '2003-06-25 07:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
