(337421, 26098, 7263, '<td valign="top">Really nice composition here - 10 for that. I woudl however have gotten rid of teh blue - it doesn;t go with the overall photograph and sticks out like a sore thumb. Also seem to be ever so slightly oof.<br/> <br/>Great shot and good luck</td>', 'Really nice composition here - 10 for that. I woudl however have gotten rid of teh blue - it doesn;t go with the overall photograph and sticks out like a sore thumb. Also seem to be ever so slightly oof. Great shot and good luck', '2003-06-25 08:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
