(337424, 26255, 7263, '<td valign="top">I see where your comming from, but it''s out of focus and very pixeleated. what camera did you use?</td>', 'I see where your comming from, but it''s out of focus and very pixeleated. what camera did you use?', '2003-06-25 08:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
