(338015, 26304, 8327, '<td valign="top">As a thunderstorm pic,  the storm is too far away, and not enough detail around the thunderheads. The lowflying closer clouds are obscuring too much of the storm. It would have been preferrable to leave the ground out entirely (and the bright green dot), but then you loose the ''country'' connection.<br/>How many pictures did you need to shoot before capturing the lightning?</td>', 'As a thunderstorm pic,  the storm is too far away, and not enough detail around the thunderheads. The lowflying closer clouds are obscuring too much of the storm. It would have been preferrable to leave the ground out entirely (and the bright green dot), but then you loose the ''country'' connection.How many pictures did you need to shoot before capturing the lightning?', '2003-06-25 15:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
