(338483, 26265, 7908, '<td valign="top">Beautiful ... I love the subtle lines in the sky. An interesting twist on leading lines to subject ... here, they draw me away from the major subjects to really see the details throughout the scene.</td>', 'Beautiful ... I love the subtle lines in the sky. An interesting twist on leading lines to subject ... here, they draw me away from the major subjects to really see the details throughout the scene.', '2003-06-25 22:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(338486, 26247, 772, '<td valign="top">Laid back... relaxed... happy...  all elements of a strong image of rural life. He looks like a hard working man.  A hard day''s work is usually a part of life in the country.  The straw in his mouth really adds a nice element here as well.  The toning also lends itself nicely to the mood of the image.  This photo definitely gets a 10.  My only complaing is that I would rather see it larger to accent some of the detail of the environment here... great work...</td>', 'Laid back... relaxed... happy...  all elements of a strong image of rural life. He looks like a hard working man.  A hard day''s work is usually a part of life in the country.  The straw in his mouth really adds a nice element here as well.  The toning also lends itself nicely to the mood of the image.  This photo definitely gets a 10.  My only complaing is that I would rather see it larger to accent some of the detail of the environment here... great work...', '2003-06-25 23:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
