(338691, 26319, 1280, '<td valign="top">I love it...reminds me of upstate New York.  Nice that you captured a curve in the road. That rustic fence is so nice too.</td>', 'I love it...reminds me of upstate New York.  Nice that you captured a curve in the road. That rustic fence is so nice too.', '2003-06-26 02:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
