(338864, 25650, 5728, '<td valign="top">Pacific coast of which country? Nice shot, it reminds my of one of those military cemeteries where all the grave stones are lined up like this! Maybe a tad on the dark side your image, but still good - 8.</td>', 'Pacific coast of which country? Nice shot, it reminds my of one of those military cemeteries where all the grave stones are lined up like this! Maybe a tad on the dark side your image, but still good - 8.', '2003-06-26 07:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(338869, 25713, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good use of natural framing, although I think there is a bit too much of the inside of the room compared to the actual main subject which is the country outside. Amazing contrasts between dark and light, I know how difficult it is to shoot from a dark room into the light, well done - 8.</td>', 'Good use of natural framing, although I think there is a bit too much of the inside of the room compared to the actual main subject which is the country outside. Amazing contrasts between dark and light, I know how difficult it is to shoot from a dark room into the light, well done - 8.', '2003-06-26 07:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(338871, 26039, 5728, '<td valign="top">Flower shots always work with me, especially if they are good like this one. Just a pity you cropped the left side of the flower off tho - 8.</td>', 'Flower shots always work with me, especially if they are good like this one. Just a pity you cropped the left side of the flower off tho - 8.', '2003-06-26 07:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
