(338880, 25396, 5728, '<td valign="top">It does look kind of British for sure. The composition is good although one thing seems to bother me and I can''t put my finger on it. Something to do with the wall in the front, either it is too dark or there is too much of it showing so it is blocking. Or maybe both. Other than that still good - 8.</td>', 'It does look kind of British for sure. The composition is good although one thing seems to bother me and I can''t put my finger on it. Something to do with the wall in the front, either it is too dark or there is too much of it showing so it is blocking. Or maybe both. Other than that still good - 8.', '2003-06-26 08:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(338881, 25685, 5728, '<td valign="top">At first I thought this was a flying frog :-) Its face does kind of look like a frog doesn''t it? Good composition, the main subjects are in focus and the background nicely blurred out. Maybe just a little too much motion blur as some of the wing has disappeared. Perhaps a faster shutter speed could have improved that. The lighting is perfect - 8.</td>', 'At first I thought this was a flying frog :-) Its face does kind of look like a frog doesn''t it? Good composition, the main subjects are in focus and the background nicely blurred out. Maybe just a little too much motion blur as some of the wing has disappeared. Perhaps a faster shutter speed could have improved that. The lighting is perfect - 8.', '2003-06-26 08:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
