(339036, 25801, 4482, '<td valign="top">What can I say?? Truly inspiring!! my number 1 of the week!!!</td>', 'What can I say?? Truly inspiring!! my number 1 of the week!!!', '2003-06-26 12:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(339038, 26223, 157, '<td valign="top">Excellent viewpoint and coloration. I wish you could see more colours however...it''s hard for me to picture the colour of the water and plants. A very inviting shot.</td>', 'Excellent viewpoint and coloration. I wish you could see more colours however...it''s hard for me to picture the colour of the water and plants. A very inviting shot.', '2003-06-26 12:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(339039, 26035, 157, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot. The viewpoint, the skyline...the brightness...everything is so crisp. An 8 :)</td>', 'Gorgeous shot. The viewpoint, the skyline...the brightness...everything is so crisp. An 8 :)', '2003-06-26 12:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(339040, 26198, 157, '<td valign="top">his eyes are so charming.. he almost seems in love with his sappy smile. It''s too bad he''s gonna end up on someone''s plate. (Bitter vegetarian here)</td>', 'his eyes are so charming.. he almost seems in love with his sappy smile. It''s too bad he''s gonna end up on someone''s plate. (Bitter vegetarian here)', '2003-06-26 12:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(339042, 26239, 157, '<td valign="top">I love this one. It could be used in advertisements. I love the white background and the cropping. A gem! I give it a 9. (I''d like to know how you managed to get that ackground by the way)</td>', 'I love this one. It could be used in advertisements. I love the white background and the cropping. A gem! I give it a 9. (I''d like to know how you managed to get that ackground by the way)', '2003-06-26 12:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(339044, 26129, 157, '<td valign="top">beautiful lighting and positioning. Makes me sad just looking at her though...poor thing. An 8 in my book.</td>', 'beautiful lighting and positioning. Makes me sad just looking at her though...poor thing. An 8 in my book.', '2003-06-26 12:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(339046, 26222, 157, '<td valign="top">National Geographic potential..but that orange flag takes a bit of the natural beauty away from it all. Still, it''s a solid 8 in my book.</td>', 'National Geographic potential..but that orange flag takes a bit of the natural beauty away from it all. Still, it''s a solid 8 in my book.', '2003-06-26 12:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(339047, 26013, 157, '<td valign="top">very good saturation, or whatever you did to it (I''d be interested in knowing what steps you took). Chickens always look bothered, so I love the essence of your shot. Excellnt focus quality as well. I give you an 8.</td>', 'very good saturation, or whatever you did to it (I''d be interested in knowing what steps you took). Chickens always look bothered, so I love the essence of your shot. Excellnt focus quality as well. I give you an 8.', '2003-06-26 12:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(339048, 26335, 157, '<td valign="top">it''s a great subject, but the shadow takes the attention away from it a abit. Good aperture settings.</td>', 'it''s a great subject, but the shadow takes the attention away from it a abit. Good aperture settings.', '2003-06-26 12:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(339050, 25879, 157, '<td valign="top">Ooo...I really like the perspective on this one! Usually people try to capture the gold tones behind it. Yours are more earthy, I like that. The textures in the field make you want to rub it down to see if it''s as soft as it looks. Excellent job. I give you a 9.</td>', 'Ooo...I really like the perspective on this one! Usually people try to capture the gold tones behind it. Yours are more earthy, I like that. The textures in the field make you want to rub it down to see if it''s as soft as it looks. Excellent job. I give you a 9.', '2003-06-26 12:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(339051, 26075, 157, '<td valign="top">Wow...very nice subject. You didn''t have to do too much for this to work eh? :)<br/>The winding road and the fence give a great perspective..the red of the flowers contrast nicely with the rest of the shot. I give you an 8.</td>', 'Wow...very nice subject. You didn''t have to do too much for this to work eh? :)The winding road and the fence give a great perspective..the red of the flowers contrast nicely with the rest of the shot. I give you an 8.', '2003-06-26 12:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(339053, 25556, 157, '<td valign="top">Stunning. The blues, the contrasting clear whites, it''s perfect.  A 9!</td>', 'Stunning. The blues, the contrasting clear whites, it''s perfect.  A 9!', '2003-06-26 12:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(339055, 25723, 8522, '<td valign="top">Lots of infra-red out there! I would have prefered the horizon level, and more detail in the whites of the leaves... they look a little overexposed to me. Other than that, very striking, effective picture. I would also have liked something to break up the regularity of the patterned trees. 7</td>', 'Lots of infra-red out there! I would have prefered the horizon level, and more detail in the whites of the leaves... they look a little overexposed to me. Other than that, very striking, effective picture. I would also have liked something to break up the regularity of the patterned trees. 7', '2003-06-26 13:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(339056, 26213, 8522, '<td valign="top">Chickens are great, aren''t they? Yours has great character, but there''s a few things that detract for me:<br/>I would have liked the face a bit sharper, specifically in the area of the eyes.<br/>There''s a shadow across his right side that I don''t think is effective.<br/>The white feathers on the right are a bit too bright... you can''t make out the details.<br/>The background takes away from the composition: The white path and tractor(?) distract the eye from the chicken, as well as the horizon cutting across the face.<br/>The red thingy above the face is too deeply saturated... you can''t make out any detail in it.<br/>Phew, that''s it now! Good picture otherwise! 6</td>', 'Chickens are great, aren''t they? Yours has great character, but there''s a few things that detract for me:I would have liked the face a bit sharper, specifically in the area of the eyes.There''s a shadow across his right side that I don''t think is effective.The white feathers on the right are a bit too bright... you can''t make out the details.The background takes away from the composition: The white path and tractor(?) distract the eye from the chicken, as well as the horizon cutting across the face.The red thingy above the face is too deeply saturated... you can''t make out any detail in it.Phew, that''s it now! Good picture otherwise! 6', '2003-06-26 13:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(339058, 26234, 1176, '<td valign="top">Is the pole tilted or the photo?<br/>Wery sharp photo, but a bit to bussy for me</td>', 'Is the pole tilted or the photo?Wery sharp photo, but a bit to bussy for me', '2003-06-26 13:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
