(339107, 25713, 806, '<td valign="top">I''d love to know how you get these shots! love the framing, and the subject beyond. Do you use a fill flash because of the contrasts of dark inside and bright outside?<br/></td>', 'I''d love to know how you get these shots! love the framing, and the subject beyond. Do you use a fill flash because of the contrasts of dark inside and bright outside?', '2003-06-26 13:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
