(339116, 26222, 806, '<td valign="top">1) if spot editing were allowed, I''d have taken out that annoying orange flag. of course, you can do that later.<br/> <br/>2) If I were allowed - or physically able to - I''d have removed the orange flag, taken the photo, and then put it back.<br/> <br/>__________<br/> <br/>This is a lovely photograph. the reflections, the calm feeling, the setting, the angle of the water and homes leading the viewer''s eye into the scene.<br/> <br/>gah! if not for that little orange flag. ....... ;)<br/> <br/></td>', '1) if spot editing were allowed, I''d have taken out that annoying orange flag. of course, you can do that later. 2) If I were allowed - or physically able to - I''d have removed the orange flag, taken the photo, and then put it back. __________ This is a lovely photograph. the reflections, the calm feeling, the setting, the angle of the water and homes leading the viewer''s eye into the scene. gah! if not for that little orange flag. ....... ;) ', '2003-06-26 13:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
