(339284, 25995, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition:  Nice shade and background..  Needs rotating slightly CW.  Did you try a pic not face on?<br/>Technical: Nice crisp pic and great colour.  It looks a little over-sharpened?<br/>Meets challenge: Yep<br/>Overall impression:  I think a non face-on pic might be better.</td>', 'Composition:  Nice shade and background..  Needs rotating slightly CW.  Did you try a pic not face on?Technical: Nice crisp pic and great colour.  It looks a little over-sharpened?Meets challenge: YepOverall impression:  I think a non face-on pic might be better.', '2003-06-26 17:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(339287, 25604, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition:  Really like the layers and wave of the skyline<br/>Technical: Fantastic focus and colour<br/>Meets challenge: Yes<br/>Overall impression:  Can''t help with wishing the cloud wasn''t there.</td>', 'Composition:  Really like the layers and wave of the skylineTechnical: Fantastic focus and colourMeets challenge: YesOverall impression:  Can''t help with wishing the cloud wasn''t there.', '2003-06-26 17:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(339288, 26265, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition:  Excellent use of ROT<br/>Technical:  Nice colourisation - not too bright<br/>Meets challenge: Yes<br/>Overall impression: The clouds really help the pic..  Beautiful.</td>', 'Composition:  Excellent use of ROTTechnical:  Nice colourisation - not too brightMeets challenge: YesOverall impression: The clouds really help the pic..  Beautiful.', '2003-06-26 17:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(339289, 26276, 5391, '<td valign="top">Nice to see a still life entered in this challenge.  I thought there would be more of them.  I didn''t have time to enter, but if I had, this is similar to what I would have done.  Nice job.  Perhaps a touch more lighting, specifically on the glass, to bring it out from the dark background, but overall quite nice.  The fresh baked bread really does invoke a "country" feel.</td>', 'Nice to see a still life entered in this challenge.  I thought there would be more of them.  I didn''t have time to enter, but if I had, this is similar to what I would have done.  Nice job.  Perhaps a touch more lighting, specifically on the glass, to bring it out from the dark background, but overall quite nice.  The fresh baked bread really does invoke a "country" feel.', '2003-06-26 17:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(339292, 25586, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: Nice use of foreground for depth.  The tree in the mid-ground looks a bit out of place though.  Needs rotating CCW<br/>Technical: Good quality and use of duotone.<br/>Meets challenge: Yes<br/>Overall impression: Nice choice of subject, not sure on the composition.</td>', 'Composition: Nice use of foreground for depth.  The tree in the mid-ground looks a bit out of place though.  Needs rotating CCWTechnical: Good quality and use of duotone.Meets challenge: YesOverall impression: Nice choice of subject, not sure on the composition.', '2003-06-26 17:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(339294, 25849, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: nice vertically, but a little too centralised.<br/>Technical: Flash makes the colours a little harsh.<br/>Meets challenge: Pushing it a little. :-)<br/>Overall impression: Fun shot, but not sure challenge-wise.</td>', 'Composition: nice vertically, but a little too centralised.Technical: Flash makes the colours a little harsh.Meets challenge: Pushing it a little. :-)Overall impression: Fun shot, but not sure challenge-wise.', '2003-06-26 17:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(339296, 25936, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: Excellent cropping.  You''ve not got too much detail in, but enough to get the message across - that''s a good thing!<br/>Technical: Good focus and colourisation.<br/>Meets challenge: Yes<br/>Overall impression: Captured the moment well.</td>', 'Composition: Excellent cropping.  You''ve not got too much detail in, but enough to get the message across - that''s a good thing!Technical: Good focus and colourisation.Meets challenge: YesOverall impression: Captured the moment well.', '2003-06-26 17:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(339297, 26249, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: Nice use of trees to border the pic.  Looks like it needs rotating though..<br/>Technical:  Nice colour and focus.  I think I might have opted for a simpler border, with the use of trees.<br/>Meets challenge: Yes<br/>Overall impression: Nice, but the horizon angle detracts from the shot.</td>', 'Composition: Nice use of trees to border the pic.  Looks like it needs rotating though..Technical:  Nice colour and focus.  I think I might have opted for a simpler border, with the use of trees.Meets challenge: YesOverall impression: Nice, but the horizon angle detracts from the shot.', '2003-06-26 17:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(339299, 26118, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: Nice aspect of the pic<br/>Technical: Fanastic focus and DOF.<br/>Meets challenge: A bit iffy I think..<br/>Overall impression: Good, but it could be taken anywhere (..with flowers!)</td>', 'Composition: Nice aspect of the picTechnical: Fanastic focus and DOF.Meets challenge: A bit iffy I think..Overall impression: Good, but it could be taken anywhere (..with flowers!)', '2003-06-26 17:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(339301, 25590, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: The windows at the top detract a little, otherwise spot on for me.<br/>Technical: Nice focus &amp; colour.  Good capturing of the mood.<br/>Meets challenge: Yes.<br/>Overall impression: Good, but those windows really focus the eye.</td>', 'Composition: The windows at the top detract a little, otherwise spot on for me.Technical: Nice focus & colour.  Good capturing of the mood.Meets challenge: Yes.Overall impression: Good, but those windows really focus the eye.', '2003-06-26 17:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(339302, 26066, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: Nice depth to the pic<br/>Technical: Excellent focus and colour - a photo that ISN''T duotone!<br/>Meets challenge: Mostly<br/>Overall impression: Technically very good, but not sure from a interest point of view.</td>', 'Composition: Nice depth to the picTechnical: Excellent focus and colour - a photo that ISN''T duotone!Meets challenge: MostlyOverall impression: Technically very good, but not sure from a interest point of view.', '2003-06-26 17:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(339303, 25954, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: Interesting use of depth.<br/>Technical: Subject is very out of alignment with border, which draws the eye.<br/>Meets challenge: Yes<br/>Overall impression: Not sure about the tractor, the background could have made a great shot I think.</td>', 'Composition: Interesting use of depth.Technical: Subject is very out of alignment with border, which draws the eye.Meets challenge: YesOverall impression: Not sure about the tractor, the background could have made a great shot I think.', '2003-06-26 17:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(339304, 26135, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: I really like the use of thirds and depth.<br/>Technical: Woah - grain-o-rama!  Heavy sharpening also sharpens noise.<br/>Meets challenge: Yes<br/>Overall impression: This could have been really excellent, but the grain lets it down.</td>', 'Composition: I really like the use of thirds and depth.Technical: Woah - grain-o-rama!  Heavy sharpening also sharpens noise.Meets challenge: YesOverall impression: This could have been really excellent, but the grain lets it down.', '2003-06-26 17:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(339306, 26064, 5391, '<td valign="top">That is flippin'' hysterical.  Great job at putting this together.  It got a laugh out of me, and I needed it after the last 200 barn shots...  (not that there weren''t GOOD barn shots, it''s just fun to see a humorous image!)  8</td>', 'That is flippin'' hysterical.  Great job at putting this together.  It got a laugh out of me, and I needed it after the last 200 barn shots...  (not that there weren''t GOOD barn shots, it''s just fun to see a humorous image!)  8', '2003-06-26 17:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(339309, 26172, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: I see your intent with the tree, but not sure if it helps or not..<br/>Technical: Sky looks a little grainy?  Otherwise spot on.<br/>Meets challenge: Yes<br/>Overall impression: All the right stuff was there, I think the comp is lacking very slightly..</td>', 'Composition: I see your intent with the tree, but not sure if it helps or not..Technical: Sky looks a little grainy?  Otherwise spot on.Meets challenge: YesOverall impression: All the right stuff was there, I think the comp is lacking very slightly..', '2003-06-26 17:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(339310, 26228, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: Nice use of ROT.  Maybe set the house a little further to the right?<br/>Technical: The pic looks dark on the grass/trees..  A little vibrance may help a bit.<br/>Meets challenge: Yes<br/>Overall impression: Nice pic.</td>', 'Composition: Nice use of ROT.  Maybe set the house a little further to the right?Technical: The pic looks dark on the grass/trees..  A little vibrance may help a bit.Meets challenge: YesOverall impression: Nice pic.', '2003-06-26 17:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(339311, 26286, 6806, '<td valign="top">This is a very pretty and serene picture</td>', 'This is a very pretty and serene picture', '2003-06-26 17:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(339312, 26060, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: Pic looks a little cluttered, which may be the focus.  Otherwise, very good choice.  May have cropped that little white line at the top out.<br/>Technical: I really like the lighting.<br/>Meets challenge: Yes<br/>Overall impression: Very interesting, but the b&amp;w makes it a strain to process the pic.</td>', 'Composition: Pic looks a little cluttered, which may be the focus.  Otherwise, very good choice.  May have cropped that little white line at the top out.Technical: I really like the lighting.Meets challenge: YesOverall impression: Very interesting, but the b&w makes it a strain to process the pic.', '2003-06-26 17:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(339313, 25591, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: I think the lack of straight lines makes this really hard to shoot.  Nice work with what you had, but I might have tried a different angle or subject.<br/>Technical: Good focus and colour - and it is COLOUR!<br/>Meets challenge: Yes<br/>Overall impression: Nice pic.  Slightly issue with leading the eye towards left?</td>', 'Composition: I think the lack of straight lines makes this really hard to shoot.  Nice work with what you had, but I might have tried a different angle or subject.Technical: Good focus and colour - and it is COLOUR!Meets challenge: YesOverall impression: Nice pic.  Slightly issue with leading the eye towards left?', '2003-06-26 17:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(339314, 25993, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: Spot on for me<br/>Technical: Nice lighting and contrast<br/>Meets challenge: Yes<br/>Overall impression: Excellent quality.  I wouldn''t be surprised with a top 10.</td>', 'Composition: Spot on for meTechnical: Nice lighting and contrastMeets challenge: YesOverall impression: Excellent quality.  I wouldn''t be surprised with a top 10.', '2003-06-26 17:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(339315, 25978, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: Spot on<br/>Technical: Fanastic colours and gradient of the sky.  A weenie bit grainy, but not too noticable (and considering it''s IR, I won''t complain!)<br/>Meets challenge: Yes<br/>Overall impression: A very memorable shot.</td>', 'Composition: Spot onTechnical: Fanastic colours and gradient of the sky.  A weenie bit grainy, but not too noticable (and considering it''s IR, I won''t complain!)Meets challenge: YesOverall impression: A very memorable shot.', '2003-06-26 17:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
