(339342, 26271, 1280, '<td valign="top">The composition, and subject are wonderful.   I love that you included the hay in the foreground which adds a nice textural dimension.<br/>On my screen the sky is seriously pixelized.  It is detrimental to this pic.  It may be that your camera is giving you trouble, with low pixels,  or perhaps in processing. <br/>I like every things else about this.  Some wonderful details like the wheel in the lower right corner and the beautiful, rustic fence.<br/></td>', 'The composition, and subject are wonderful.   I love that you included the hay in the foreground which adds a nice textural dimension.On my screen the sky is seriously pixelized.  It is detrimental to this pic.  It may be that your camera is giving you trouble, with low pixels,  or perhaps in processing. I like every things else about this.  Some wonderful details like the wheel in the lower right corner and the beautiful, rustic fence.', '2003-06-26 18:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(339343, 26066, 1280, '<td valign="top">Quaint, peaceful, cozy, good job!</td>', 'Quaint, peaceful, cozy, good job!', '2003-06-26 18:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(339344, 25435, 7350, '<td valign="top">Composition:  perfect.<br/>Subject:  perfect.<br/>Focus: pretty good.<br/>Lighting:  I really wish you could have gotten everything more in the sun - the bottom part looks overexposed, and the top part looks underexposed, all because of the shadow.<br/>Overall: 7.</td>', 'Composition:  perfect.Subject:  perfect.Focus: pretty good.Lighting:  I really wish you could have gotten everything more in the sun - the bottom part looks overexposed, and the top part looks underexposed, all because of the shadow.Overall: 7.', '2003-06-26 18:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
