(339354, 26060, 1280, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but it is difficult to see details. The lighting was challenging.  If you exposed for the shadows,  the tire would be too bright.  If you exposed for the brightness on the tire, then the rest becomes under-exposed. Perhaps the best solution would be a different time of day.<br/>Best of luck in all the challenges.</td>', 'I like the idea, but it is difficult to see details. The lighting was challenging.  If you exposed for the shadows,  the tire would be too bright.  If you exposed for the brightness on the tire, then the rest becomes under-exposed. Perhaps the best solution would be a different time of day.Best of luck in all the challenges.', '2003-06-26 18:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
