(339378, 26105, 4122, '<td valign="top">out of focus.</td>', 'out of focus.', '2003-06-26 18:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(339379, 26312, 8860, '<td valign="top">What a lot of effort - building a time machine and all! Nice pic although possibly just a bit heavy on the FX/filters.</td>', 'What a lot of effort - building a time machine and all! Nice pic although possibly just a bit heavy on the FX/filters.', '2003-06-26 18:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(339386, 25986, 280, '<td valign="top">Focus seems a little soft and I find the border a little distracting.</td>', 'Focus seems a little soft and I find the border a little distracting.', '2003-06-26 18:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(339387, 25532, 4400, '<td valign="top">OK This is different, country pineapple or  supermarket  pineapple dont''t know 2pt<br/> <br/></td>', 'OK This is different, country pineapple or  supermarket  pineapple dont''t know 2pt ', '2003-06-26 18:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(339391, 25656, 7350, '<td valign="top">Hairy...8.</td>', 'Hairy...8.', '2003-06-26 18:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(339392, 26335, 7350, '<td valign="top">I wish it were all in the sun, or all in the shade.  It''s a little confusing to see the shadow and not know what''s casting it.</td>', 'I wish it were all in the sun, or all in the shade.  It''s a little confusing to see the shadow and not know what''s casting it.', '2003-06-26 18:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(339399, 26123, 1280, '<td valign="top">Pretty scene.  I can''t tell for sure what is in the field.  Are they hay bales? Or perhaps bee hives?  I like your composition.</td>', 'Pretty scene.  I can''t tell for sure what is in the field.  Are they hay bales? Or perhaps bee hives?  I like your composition.', '2003-06-26 19:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(339409, 25847, 1280, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this....very nostalgic.  The focus is kind of soft though.  Too soft.</td>', 'I like the idea of this....very nostalgic.  The focus is kind of soft though.  Too soft.', '2003-06-26 19:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(339410, 26051, 7350, '<td valign="top">Woah!  Way too bright.  And gross.</td>', 'Woah!  Way too bright.  And gross.', '2003-06-26 19:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(339411, 26024, 7350, '<td valign="top">A little over exposed at the top.</td>', 'A little over exposed at the top.', '2003-06-26 19:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(339412, 25696, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice space in this one - with a feeling of gentle anticipation.</td>', 'Nice space in this one - with a feeling of gentle anticipation.', '2003-06-26 19:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(339413, 26234, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.</td>', 'Nice colors.', '2003-06-26 19:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(339414, 26200, 7350, '<td valign="top">Fantastic colors and detail.  Maybe just a tiny bit over-bright (ie, the butt of the bee).  I''ll give it a 9, anyway.</td>', 'Fantastic colors and detail.  Maybe just a tiny bit over-bright (ie, the butt of the bee).  I''ll give it a 9, anyway.', '2003-06-26 19:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(339416, 25910, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice scene.  The composition could be improved by having the bale off-center and  perhaps a little further away, so it wouldn''t dominate the scene so much.  Your use of texture is good!<br/></td>', 'Nice scene.  The composition could be improved by having the bale off-center and  perhaps a little further away, so it wouldn''t dominate the scene so much.  Your use of texture is good!', '2003-06-26 19:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(339423, 25435, 6600, '<td valign="top">Love this shot...  the dog makes it for me, kind of sets the mood for the hole shot.  Well done!</td>', 'Love this shot...  the dog makes it for me, kind of sets the mood for the hole shot.  Well done!', '2003-06-26 19:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(339426, 25974, 6600, '<td valign="top">Neat shot, what a vast area!  Nicely done.</td>', 'Neat shot, what a vast area!  Nicely done.', '2003-06-26 19:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(339427, 26258, 1280, '<td valign="top">Lol....cute.  I''ve worked at haying...tough, tough job!  It''s hot, and itchy, and pity anyone who has an allergy...  You captured a very country scene...very real.  Good luck!  :-)</td>', 'Lol....cute.  I''ve worked at haying...tough, tough job!  It''s hot, and itchy, and pity anyone who has an allergy...  You captured a very country scene...very real.  Good luck!  :-)', '2003-06-26 19:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(339428, 26098, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice job of capturing the silhouette, and the color.  Beautifully framed.  I see a little detail on the left, would like more all around.  OVerall nice pic.</td>', 'Nice job of capturing the silhouette, and the color.  Beautifully framed.  I see a little detail on the left, would like more all around.  OVerall nice pic.', '2003-06-26 19:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(339429, 26247, 6600, '<td valign="top">Like the shot, nice portraiture (but the hat looks out of place or staged to me).</td>', 'Like the shot, nice portraiture (but the hat looks out of place or staged to me).', '2003-06-26 19:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(339430, 25814, 1280, '<td valign="top">Good depiction of life in the country.</td>', 'Good depiction of life in the country.', '2003-06-26 19:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(339433, 25370, 1280, '<td valign="top">This subject has lots of interest.  It is tilted though.  This can easily be fixed by rotating and cropping a bit.  Also by backing up you could have included the legs.  I hope this is helpful to you. :-)</td>', 'This subject has lots of interest.  It is tilted though.  This can easily be fixed by rotating and cropping a bit.  Also by backing up you could have included the legs.  I hope this is helpful to you. :-)', '2003-06-26 19:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(339436, 26114, 6600, '<td valign="top">Not much here to keep one''s interest.  Country Home?  Now sure I woujld have made that connection without your lead.</td>', 'Not much here to keep one''s interest.  Country Home?  Now sure I woujld have made that connection without your lead.', '2003-06-26 19:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(339438, 26075, 1280, '<td valign="top">Pretty.  I like the way the fence draws me into the house.</td>', 'Pretty.  I like the way the fence draws me into the house.', '2003-06-26 19:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(339439, 26200, 1280, '<td valign="top">Good job!  Good color and dof.</td>', 'Good job!  Good color and dof.', '2003-06-26 20:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(339441, 26098, 6600, '<td valign="top">Cool silloute, contrast is nice, maybe a tad dark, but works for me.</td>', 'Cool silloute, contrast is nice, maybe a tad dark, but works for me.', '2003-06-26 20:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(339443, 25850, 1280, '<td valign="top">Pretty scene.  The coloring is a bit dull.  Perhaps it''s just the season.  Great curve in the road, leads in nicely.</td>', 'Pretty scene.  The coloring is a bit dull.  Perhaps it''s just the season.  Great curve in the road, leads in nicely.', '2003-06-26 20:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(339444, 25919, 6600, '<td valign="top">Well composed, invites you into the picture.  Very good exposure throughout.  Great job!</td>', 'Well composed, invites you into the picture.  Very good exposure throughout.  Great job!', '2003-06-26 20:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(339448, 26254, 1280, '<td valign="top">The color is gorgeous!  The house is on a slant, along with the horizon.  Could have been rotated with software easily enough.  I can''t tell what the white thing is on the left...I think I see a leg...a goat maybe?  In the stream on the left is something in red and black that I can''t discern.</td>', 'The color is gorgeous!  The house is on a slant, along with the horizon.  Could have been rotated with software easily enough.  I can''t tell what the white thing is on the left...I think I see a leg...a goat maybe?  In the stream on the left is something in red and black that I can''t discern.', '2003-06-26 20:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(339449, 25401, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice scene, well composed,  and good colors.</td>', 'Nice scene, well composed,  and good colors.', '2003-06-26 20:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(339451, 26239, 6600, '<td valign="top">Kind of makes me laugh :)</td>', 'Kind of makes me laugh :)', '2003-06-26 20:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(339452, 26071, 6600, '<td valign="top">Cute pic (border ruined it for me though - keeps drawing the eye right out of the picture).</td>', 'Cute pic (border ruined it for me though - keeps drawing the eye right out of the picture).', '2003-06-26 20:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(339453, 26095, 6600, '<td valign="top">Quite dramatic, nicely done.</td>', 'Quite dramatic, nicely done.', '2003-06-26 20:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(339454, 26051, 6600, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit overexposed to me.</td>', 'Seems a bit overexposed to me.', '2003-06-26 20:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(339456, 26215, 6600, '<td valign="top">Neat shot, but I think the wicker basket should have been moved.</td>', 'Neat shot, but I think the wicker basket should have been moved.', '2003-06-26 20:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(339457, 25801, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice slice of nostalgia.</td>', 'Nice slice of nostalgia.', '2003-06-26 20:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(339458, 26213, 1280, '<td valign="top">Funny.  What a lop-sided comb he''s got....lol</td>', 'Funny.  What a lop-sided comb he''s got....lol', '2003-06-26 20:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(339462, 26305, 1280, '<td valign="top">Another one of the simple pleasures of life in the country.  As you know, I''m sure, it would be a better pic without the trampoline, but it''s not as if you could plan this out...lol</td>', 'Another one of the simple pleasures of life in the country.  As you know, I''m sure, it would be a better pic without the trampoline, but it''s not as if you could plan this out...lol', '2003-06-26 20:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(339465, 25543, 6600, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and composition.  Looks like a nice day for a day dream.</td>', 'Nice idea and composition.  Looks like a nice day for a day dream.', '2003-06-26 20:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(339466, 26043, 1280, '<td valign="top">This door is interesting.  I''m not sure how it actually depicts country. I''d have cropped out the stuff over the door.  It draws attention from the door.</td>', 'This door is interesting.  I''m not sure how it actually depicts country. I''d have cropped out the stuff over the door.  It draws attention from the door.', '2003-06-26 20:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(339467, 26123, 6600, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, very open territory.  Nice shot!</td>', 'Nice composition, very open territory.  Nice shot!', '2003-06-26 20:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(339468, 26222, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice, rustic scene.</td>', 'Nice, rustic scene.', '2003-06-26 20:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(339469, 26306, 1280, '<td valign="top">I had a Toggenberg goat named Clover, and I loved her.  This is a nice reminder.Nice portrait here of Billy and his lady.</td>', 'I had a Toggenberg goat named Clover, and I loved her.  This is a nice reminder.Nice portrait here of Billy and his lady.', '2003-06-26 20:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(339470, 25337, 6600, '<td valign="top">Messed up the colors.....</td>', 'Messed up the colors.....', '2003-06-26 20:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(339472, 26129, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice face, definetly country. The perspective is a bit odd...looking down at a big animal like a  bull.  Having his legs cut off is a pity.</td>', 'Nice face, definetly country. The perspective is a bit odd...looking down at a big animal like a  bull.  Having his legs cut off is a pity.', '2003-06-26 20:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(339473, 25896, 6600, '<td valign="top">Great capture!  Beautiful ponies!  I love the coloring of back horse.  Good job!</td>', 'Great capture!  Beautiful ponies!  I love the coloring of back horse.  Good job!', '2003-06-26 20:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(339474, 25936, 1280, '<td valign="top">Oh...this brings back memories.  Some good, some bad.  We took care of several goats for a neighbor during kidding.  It was wonderful!!!  Our own dear Toggenberg died during kidding, and we lost the kids too.  Broke our heart since we were attached to Mama Clover.  She used to follow us on our hikes and we enjoyed her so much.<br/>This is a very real drama you''ve captured.  Good job....even if I am partial to goats.</td>', 'Oh...this brings back memories.  Some good, some bad.  We took care of several goats for a neighbor during kidding.  It was wonderful!!!  Our own dear Toggenberg died during kidding, and we lost the kids too.  Broke our heart since we were attached to Mama Clover.  She used to follow us on our hikes and we enjoyed her so much.This is a very real drama you''ve captured.  Good job....even if I am partial to goats.', '2003-06-26 20:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(339475, 26280, 1570, '<td valign="top">this is just stunning, very very pretty - nice framing of the estate by green of the grass and blue of the sky...  looks like ireland to me, is it? 10.</td>', 'this is just stunning, very very pretty - nice framing of the estate by green of the grass and blue of the sky...  looks like ireland to me, is it? 10.', '2003-06-26 20:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(339476, 26029, 1280, '<td valign="top">Charming, and well composed.</td>', 'Charming, and well composed.', '2003-06-26 20:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(339479, 25492, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice, simple composition.  B &amp; W was a good choice.</td>', 'Nice, simple composition.  B & W was a good choice.', '2003-06-26 20:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(339483, 25645, 1280, '<td valign="top">What a classic pose of a bull elk.  Poised just for you.  Color, and exposure are good.</td>', 'What a classic pose of a bull elk.  Poised just for you.  Color, and exposure are good.', '2003-06-26 20:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(339486, 26339, 1280, '<td valign="top">Yep...very SW indeed.  Nice.  The skull is a little difficult to make out but all in all a good one!</td>', 'Yep...very SW indeed.  Nice.  The skull is a little difficult to make out but all in all a good one!', '2003-06-26 21:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(339491, 25849, 1280, '<td valign="top">Funny...I don''t know what makes it "country" but it is cute.</td>', 'Funny...I don''t know what makes it "country" but it is cute.', '2003-06-26 21:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(339493, 26256, 8597, '<td valign="top">Your composition might be better if you had the ground leading up to the horse (instead of having the horse in the foreground).</td>', 'Your composition might be better if you had the ground leading up to the horse (instead of having the horse in the foreground).', '2003-06-26 21:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(339495, 25468, 1280, '<td valign="top">This is cute.  It does depict growing up in, and life in the country.  Trees ARE for climbing.  Well captured.</td>', 'This is cute.  It does depict growing up in, and life in the country.  Trees ARE for climbing.  Well captured.', '2003-06-26 21:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(339497, 26314, 8597, '<td valign="top">Nice texture -- might be a more interesting image if you sharpened it up a bit.</td>', 'Nice texture -- might be a more interesting image if you sharpened it up a bit.', '2003-06-26 21:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(339500, 25846, 8597, '<td valign="top">Nice image -- might be nicer if you could bring out the blue of the sky a bit more.</td>', 'Nice image -- might be nicer if you could bring out the blue of the sky a bit more.', '2003-06-26 21:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(339504, 25801, 6600, '<td valign="top">Nice pic!  Good composition and color tone. Great job!  Critique: I would have had the banjo supported somewhere (he appears to be resting/sleeping while supporting the banjo, you would think it would fall).</td>', 'Nice pic!  Good composition and color tone. Great job!  Critique: I would have had the banjo supported somewhere (he appears to be resting/sleeping while supporting the banjo, you would think it would fall).', '2003-06-26 21:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(339506, 25910, 6600, '<td valign="top">Nice color, very sharp, cool backdrop.  Great job!</td>', 'Nice color, very sharp, cool backdrop.  Great job!', '2003-06-26 21:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(339507, 26163, 6600, '<td valign="top">Cool shot (IR?)....  Nice job!</td>', 'Cool shot (IR?)....  Nice job!', '2003-06-26 21:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(339508, 25938, 8597, '<td valign="top">Nice property!  In my opinion, this image needs a focal point of interest.</td>', 'Nice property!  In my opinion, this image needs a focal point of interest.', '2003-06-26 21:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(339510, 25356, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice one</td>', 'Nice one', '2003-06-26 21:18:22.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(339511, 26312, 6600, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!  Nice color, exposure, and composition.  (border a bit wide for my taste - draws my eye out of the picture).</td>', 'Nicely done!  Nice color, exposure, and composition.  (border a bit wide for my taste - draws my eye out of the picture).', '2003-06-26 21:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(339512, 26255, 8597, '<td valign="top">I like the setting, but your image is overexposed and underfocused.  Some more color contrast might help too.</td>', 'I like the setting, but your image is overexposed and underfocused.  Some more color contrast might help too.', '2003-06-26 21:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(339515, 25993, 8597, '<td valign="top">Great idea to shoot this from the height of the middle horizontal post!</td>', 'Great idea to shoot this from the height of the middle horizontal post!', '2003-06-26 21:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(339516, 26061, 9116, '<td valign="top">a very special atmosphere, you''ve created there. compliments.</td>', 'a very special atmosphere, you''ve created there. compliments.', '2003-06-26 21:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(339517, 26198, 1647, '<td valign="top">It''s a great photo of the pig.  I might have tried a funnier title like "He''s a real pig", and I don''t particularly like the border - it makes the picture harder to look at, especially around the ears.</td>', 'It''s a great photo of the pig.  I might have tried a funnier title like "He''s a real pig", and I don''t particularly like the border - it makes the picture harder to look at, especially around the ears.', '2003-06-26 21:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(339518, 26248, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very nice...her teat is so ready to feed her baby!!! Good texture.</td>', 'Very nice...her teat is so ready to feed her baby!!! Good texture.', '2003-06-26 21:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(339519, 26304, 1647, '<td valign="top">Lovely moody shot - I like the colours and the lightning really adds a focal point to the image.  Well done.</td>', 'Lovely moody shot - I like the colours and the lightning really adds a focal point to the image.  Well done.', '2003-06-26 21:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(339520, 26327, 8597, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, this image is underexposed and needs a point of focal interest.</td>', 'In my opinion, this image is underexposed and needs a point of focal interest.', '2003-06-26 21:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(339522, 26079, 1647, '<td valign="top">Great work.  I love the clarity and sharpness of this image.  The sepia toning is great (much better than my poor attempt) and the image just looks so "country".  Well done.</td>', 'Great work.  I love the clarity and sharpness of this image.  The sepia toning is great (much better than my poor attempt) and the image just looks so "country".  Well done.', '2003-06-26 21:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(339524, 26332, 1280, '<td valign="top">The color looks very unnatural.  Just cause I don''t care much for the color, doesn''t mean a thing...lol  It''s fun to experiment.  Keep enjoying yourself as you photograph!!!</td>', 'The color looks very unnatural.  Just cause I don''t care much for the color, doesn''t mean a thing...lol  It''s fun to experiment.  Keep enjoying yourself as you photograph!!!', '2003-06-26 21:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(339527, 26209, 1647, '<td valign="top">It''s a shame the image is slightly blurry.  Other than that it''s really good.</td>', 'It''s a shame the image is slightly blurry.  Other than that it''s really good.', '2003-06-26 21:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(339530, 26234, 8597, '<td valign="top">Nice image, although a couple of ideas for possible improvement might be to use a fill flash to light the leaves of the tree in the upper left corner and adjust the angle of your camera - it appears to be tilted approximately 10 degrees to the upper right.</td>', 'Nice image, although a couple of ideas for possible improvement might be to use a fill flash to light the leaves of the tree in the upper left corner and adjust the angle of your camera - it appears to be tilted approximately 10 degrees to the upper right.', '2003-06-26 21:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(339532, 25945, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very much "tapestry-like!"  Good choice of title.  Lovely patterns.</td>', 'Very much "tapestry-like!"  Good choice of title.  Lovely patterns.', '2003-06-26 21:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(339534, 25959, 8597, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and use of DOF. I especially like how the butterfly seems to almost look 3-D.</td>', 'Nice colors and use of DOF. I especially like how the butterfly seems to almost look 3-D.', '2003-06-26 21:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(339536, 25591, 7033, '<td valign="top">Very nice subject; the saturated greens work well to offset the weathered wood.  Only one problem, in my opinion... the horizon line is uneven, sloping slightly to the left.  It''s exaggerated by the lines of the loading ramp and fence, making it somewhat distracting.  A rotation of a couple of degrees clockwise would fix it right up!</td>', 'Very nice subject; the saturated greens work well to offset the weathered wood.  Only one problem, in my opinion... the horizon line is uneven, sloping slightly to the left.  It''s exaggerated by the lines of the loading ramp and fence, making it somewhat distracting.  A rotation of a couple of degrees clockwise would fix it right up!', '2003-06-26 21:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(339538, 26287, 8597, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and depth of field.  Nice image.  Good fit for the theme.</td>', 'Great lighting and depth of field.  Nice image.  Good fit for the theme.', '2003-06-26 21:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(339539, 25688, 9116, '<td valign="top">a crisp, mindburning characterpicture - very nice inideed, but in my opinion not close enough to the subject</td>', 'a crisp, mindburning characterpicture - very nice inideed, but in my opinion not close enough to the subject', '2003-06-26 21:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(339540, 25713, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nicely seen and photographed.  Your "Picture window" is so literal!!!  :-)</td>', 'Nicely seen and photographed.  Your "Picture window" is so literal!!!  :-)', '2003-06-26 21:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(339547, 26034, 8597, '<td valign="top">This image has nice colors, but might be nicer if you crop out the electrical wire...</td>', 'This image has nice colors, but might be nicer if you crop out the electrical wire...', '2003-06-26 21:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(339548, 26211, 1280, '<td valign="top">sheeeeeeeeshe!!!  Pretty moldy, funky boot ya got!  You don''t really wear these, DO YOU???<br/>Composition, texture, exposure, and dof, are all good.</td>', 'sheeeeeeeeshe!!!  Pretty moldy, funky boot ya got!  You don''t really wear these, DO YOU???Composition, texture, exposure, and dof, are all good.', '2003-06-26 21:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(339549, 25879, 7033, '<td valign="top">VERY nice shot!  (And one of my favorites so far...)  The yellowish duotone works well, in my opinion, creating a warmth to your shot that draws the viewer in.  The leading lines of the rows of cut hay create a great deal of interest, and force me to examine the entire shot.  --10</td>', 'VERY nice shot!  (And one of my favorites so far...)  The yellowish duotone works well, in my opinion, creating a warmth to your shot that draws the viewer in.  The leading lines of the rows of cut hay create a great deal of interest, and force me to examine the entire shot.  --10', '2003-06-26 21:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(339551, 26172, 7033, '<td valign="top">Very nice subject and composition-- and the sepia tone works nicely to set the mood.  The natural framing of the tree branches works well, but I wish I could see the object (windmill?) behind it.  In my opinion, the border is a bit bland, and detracts somewhat from your shot.</td>', 'Very nice subject and composition-- and the sepia tone works nicely to set the mood.  The natural framing of the tree branches works well, but I wish I could see the object (windmill?) behind it.  In my opinion, the border is a bit bland, and detracts somewhat from your shot.', '2003-06-26 21:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(339554, 26121, 7033, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot... and some beautiful scenery!  The focus seems slightly softened on the horse, imparting a very nice feeling to the shot, in my opinion.  One of my favorites so far!  --10</td>', 'Fantastic shot... and some beautiful scenery!  The focus seems slightly softened on the horse, imparting a very nice feeling to the shot, in my opinion.  One of my favorites so far!  --10', '2003-06-26 21:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(339555, 25978, 772, '<td valign="top">I love good infrared photos, and this one is no exception.  I think your theme here is very strong also.  This composition screams of ''death'' and ''solitude'' in some rural cemetery on a lonely country road.  The infrared creates a lot of good tension in this photo by illuminating the greenery into the normal IR glow mode.  This is an excellent entry for this challenge.  I don''t like the title... I think there is a lot of room for creative improvement there :)  Kudos on a great shot... = 10</td>', 'I love good infrared photos, and this one is no exception.  I think your theme here is very strong also.  This composition screams of ''death'' and ''solitude'' in some rural cemetery on a lonely country road.  The infrared creates a lot of good tension in this photo by illuminating the greenery into the normal IR glow mode.  This is an excellent entry for this challenge.  I don''t like the title... I think there is a lot of room for creative improvement there :)  Kudos on a great shot... = 10', '2003-06-26 21:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
