(339828, 26222, 6870, '<td valign="top">Another fine photo from Iceland! Super composition and tones.</td>', 'Another fine photo from Iceland! Super composition and tones.', '2003-06-27 03:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(339829, 25596, 8441, '<td valign="top">in my opinion the grass in the foreground does not do well for this picture.</td>', 'in my opinion the grass in the foreground does not do well for this picture.', '2003-06-27 03:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(339831, 26311, 6870, '<td valign="top">Super composition, except that I can''t see any signs of urban sprawl. NIcely saturated colors!</td>', 'Super composition, except that I can''t see any signs of urban sprawl. NIcely saturated colors!', '2003-06-27 03:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(339832, 26027, 6870, '<td valign="top">She is so light, she seems almost a ghost! I love the ducks going one way and the girl going another.</td>', 'She is so light, she seems almost a ghost! I love the ducks going one way and the girl going another.', '2003-06-27 03:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(339833, 26293, 8441, '<td valign="top">I feel as if the sky is too much, maybe if it was cropped to remove the top right cloud? The field in the foreground adds a nice effect to the picture</td>', 'I feel as if the sky is too much, maybe if it was cropped to remove the top right cloud? The field in the foreground adds a nice effect to the picture', '2003-06-27 03:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(339834, 25847, 6870, '<td valign="top">I love the tones and idea of this shot, but I really crave it to be in focus.</td>', 'I love the tones and idea of this shot, but I really crave it to be in focus.', '2003-06-27 03:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(339835, 26061, 6870, '<td valign="top">Clever and matched with engaging composition, arrangement and tones.</td>', 'Clever and matched with engaging composition, arrangement and tones.', '2003-06-27 03:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(339836, 26212, 8441, '<td valign="top">I dont feel as if there is anything that attracs my eye here.</td>', 'I dont feel as if there is anything that attracs my eye here.', '2003-06-27 03:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(339838, 26118, 8441, '<td valign="top">Very nice insect shot. the detail of the flower is brought out nicely. wish the insect was lit better.</td>', 'Very nice insect shot. the detail of the flower is brought out nicely. wish the insect was lit better.', '2003-06-27 03:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(339839, 26225, 6870, '<td valign="top">Everything is so centered; this wonderful shot would be even more wonderful, I feel if you had put things off center to imply a larger world more effectively Super colors, tones and subject.</td>', 'Everything is so centered; this wonderful shot would be even more wonderful, I feel if you had put things off center to imply a larger world more effectively Super colors, tones and subject.', '2003-06-27 03:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(339840, 26079, 8441, '<td valign="top">The sky has an interesting hue. I dont think it''s sepia, but adds to the mood of the picture.  8</td>', 'The sky has an interesting hue. I dont think it''s sepia, but adds to the mood of the picture.  8', '2003-06-27 03:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(339841, 26306, 8441, '<td valign="top">The goats are abit dark, maybe if flash fill was used?</td>', 'The goats are abit dark, maybe if flash fill was used?', '2003-06-27 03:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(339842, 26108, 8441, '<td valign="top">Nice subject, but it''s as if the picture is abit too busy(?) the object doesnt really stand out from the background</td>', 'Nice subject, but it''s as if the picture is abit too busy(?) the object doesnt really stand out from the background', '2003-06-27 03:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(339843, 25370, 6870, '<td valign="top">INteresting cropping. Tighter point of view would reveal more about the character and texture of this stove; father out and you''d get it all in. This is in the middle, and I can''t think of a good reason for the legs not to be there. Nice tones and lighting here.</td>', 'INteresting cropping. Tighter point of view would reveal more about the character and texture of this stove; father out and you''d get it all in. This is in the middle, and I can''t think of a good reason for the legs not to be there. Nice tones and lighting here.', '2003-06-27 03:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(339844, 25586, 8441, '<td valign="top">Is the castle slanted?</td>', 'Is the castle slanted?', '2003-06-27 03:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(339846, 26027, 8441, '<td valign="top">Brings out an innocent country life image.</td>', 'Brings out an innocent country life image.', '2003-06-27 03:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(339847, 25935, 6870, '<td valign="top">Super point of view. The lighting is a bit harsh, though.</td>', 'Super point of view. The lighting is a bit harsh, though.', '2003-06-27 03:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(339848, 25479, 6870, '<td valign="top">You mean "saddle"? Nice composition and textures captured via engaging tones.</td>', 'You mean "saddle"? Nice composition and textures captured via engaging tones.', '2003-06-27 03:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(339849, 25435, 6172, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo.  I do feel that the clutter is a little overdone and works against you.  I like the colors in the scene.</td>', 'Very nice photo.  I do feel that the clutter is a little overdone and works against you.  I like the colors in the scene.', '2003-06-27 03:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(339851, 25723, 6870, '<td valign="top">Weird look,but it does enhance the trees as patterns and structures in patterns. 8</td>', 'Weird look,but it does enhance the trees as patterns and structures in patterns. 8', '2003-06-27 03:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(339853, 25590, 6870, '<td valign="top">That face and pose are everything here!</td>', 'That face and pose are everything here!', '2003-06-27 03:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(339854, 25431, 6172, '<td valign="top">What are those, Javelina?  Cool shot, I like the b&amp;w and the repetition.</td>', 'What are those, Javelina?  Cool shot, I like the b&w and the repetition.', '2003-06-27 03:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(339856, 26121, 6870, '<td valign="top">Superb composition. This horse shot is engaging because of it.</td>', 'Superb composition. This horse shot is engaging because of it.', '2003-06-27 03:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(339858, 25936, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice action and story captured here in this photo. The tilted frame helps give this a feeling of artistic journalism.</td>', 'Nice action and story captured here in this photo. The tilted frame helps give this a feeling of artistic journalism.', '2003-06-27 03:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(339867, 26012, 4375, '<td valign="top">They are gorgeous but I want to see their little faces and what they are staring at.  If you had been in front of the line of children it would be an amazing photo.  I like it anyway just because they are so cute hanging on to each other like that.</td>', 'They are gorgeous but I want to see their little faces and what they are staring at.  If you had been in front of the line of children it would be an amazing photo.  I like it anyway just because they are so cute hanging on to each other like that.', '2003-06-27 03:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(339868, 26308, 4375, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  It is so simple and paintly. It''s different to all the other photos too because it got so much space and that is what the country means to me.</td>', 'I really like this.  It is so simple and paintly. It''s different to all the other photos too because it got so much space and that is what the country means to me.', '2003-06-27 03:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(339869, 26135, 4375, '<td valign="top">This is a nice clean photo.  I particularly like the track makes in the plants.  It would have been nice to have the red house a little more dominant in the photo I think however because it is such a great contrasting colour.  It looks like you know a far bit about photography because it''s such a great picture but (here goes)..........  if you use your camera lens at full zoom and stand a lot further away it makes the photo "flatter".    Meaning that things in the distance (or background) seem closer to the objects in the forground therefore making them appear bigger.   <br/>It looks like a very photo-genic place, i''m sure you had lots of fun taking this photo.</td>', 'This is a nice clean photo.  I particularly like the track makes in the plants.  It would have been nice to have the red house a little more dominant in the photo I think however because it is such a great contrasting colour.  It looks like you know a far bit about photography because it''s such a great picture but (here goes)..........  if you use your camera lens at full zoom and stand a lot further away it makes the photo "flatter".    Meaning that things in the distance (or background) seem closer to the objects in the forground therefore making them appear bigger.   It looks like a very photo-genic place, i''m sure you had lots of fun taking this photo.', '2003-06-27 04:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(339870, 26198, 4375, '<td valign="top">He looks so friendly but also very dirty!!!!!  I still like it though.</td>', 'He looks so friendly but also very dirty!!!!!  I still like it though.', '2003-06-27 04:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(339877, 25431, 4375, '<td valign="top">This is so gruesome but I love the repetition of the skull things.  I don''t think I want to know what they are or were though.  I''d probably like to see a little more contrast in it but otherwise very interesting concept.</td>', 'This is so gruesome but I love the repetition of the skull things.  I don''t think I want to know what they are or were though.  I''d probably like to see a little more contrast in it but otherwise very interesting concept.', '2003-06-27 04:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(339879, 26280, 8682, '<td valign="top">Beatiful picture... Good focus and good composition... 9</td>', 'Beatiful picture... Good focus and good composition... 9', '2003-06-27 04:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(339885, 26008, 9563, '<td valign="top">This picture is very sharp and the colors and contrast are really good. The actual subject for the picture seems somewhat ordinary.</td>', 'This picture is very sharp and the colors and contrast are really good. The actual subject for the picture seems somewhat ordinary.', '2003-06-27 05:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(339886, 25479, 9563, '<td valign="top">This is a really good set up location for this shot. It makes me feel like i''m out in the barn somewhere in the country. Fantastic sharpness and the greyscale tones work really really well with this picture. The only thing that i don''t like is the blurry bottom left corner, is is distracting and looks like a mistake.</td>', 'This is a really good set up location for this shot. It makes me feel like i''m out in the barn somewhere in the country. Fantastic sharpness and the greyscale tones work really really well with this picture. The only thing that i don''t like is the blurry bottom left corner, is is distracting and looks like a mistake.', '2003-06-27 05:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(339887, 26035, 9563, '<td valign="top">i really like this shot and how everything is in focus. I think this shot would have been even better if you had moved infront of the red machinery and just made the house your main subject. With the house, barn, mountains, and machinery all in sharp focus in the picture it makes it this shot somewhat busy.</td>', 'i really like this shot and how everything is in focus. I think this shot would have been even better if you had moved infront of the red machinery and just made the house your main subject. With the house, barn, mountains, and machinery all in sharp focus in the picture it makes it this shot somewhat busy.', '2003-06-27 05:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(339889, 26095, 9563, '<td valign="top">this is a cool shot, i''m not sure if it really goes with the country theme though...</td>', 'this is a cool shot, i''m not sure if it really goes with the country theme though...', '2003-06-27 05:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(339890, 26060, 9563, '<td valign="top">nice artsy shot</td>', 'nice artsy shot', '2003-06-27 05:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(339891, 25848, 9563, '<td valign="top">very cool shot.... poor cow :-(</td>', 'very cool shot.... poor cow :-(', '2003-06-27 05:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(339892, 26036, 9563, '<td valign="top">i really really like this shot. Sometimes it is the simplest thing that makes a great photograph. well done.</td>', 'i really really like this shot. Sometimes it is the simplest thing that makes a great photograph. well done.', '2003-06-27 05:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
