(339898, 26273, 9563, '<td valign="top">fabulous shot... one of my favorites in this bunch. Sometimes it is the simplest things that make for the best pictures. well done.</td>', 'fabulous shot... one of my favorites in this bunch. Sometimes it is the simplest things that make for the best pictures. well done.', '2003-06-27 05:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
