(340201, 26258, 6349, '<td valign="top">this really says "country life" to me more than any other photo for the challenge.  The picture itself is very good but nothing too amazing.  It''s a bit dull and could use some help in terms of composition, as it seems weighted to the right, and the light is a little bit harsh.  Still, I''m going to give this a high score for being the best representation of the challenge ideals.  Nice work.</td>', 'this really says "country life" to me more than any other photo for the challenge.  The picture itself is very good but nothing too amazing.  It''s a bit dull and could use some help in terms of composition, as it seems weighted to the right, and the light is a little bit harsh.  Still, I''m going to give this a high score for being the best representation of the challenge ideals.  Nice work.', '2003-06-27 10:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(340203, 25954, 6349, '<td valign="top">my browser froze up when it got right below his head and I was really really confused for a minute or two.  Thats a great mailbox!  The composition of the photo is excellent too.</td>', 'my browser froze up when it got right below his head and I was really really confused for a minute or two.  Thats a great mailbox!  The composition of the photo is excellent too.', '2003-06-27 10:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
