(340272, 26108, 6349, '<td valign="top">Then I have to ask, what''s it still doing there?  What''s with country folk not being able to throw things away?  lol.  jk.  cool subject, i like how it has the stuff growing around it.  It might have been more powerful if you zoomed in on a section with more interesting lines and form.</td>', 'Then I have to ask, what''s it still doing there?  What''s with country folk not being able to throw things away?  lol.  jk.  cool subject, i like how it has the stuff growing around it.  It might have been more powerful if you zoomed in on a section with more interesting lines and form.', '2003-06-27 10:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(340273, 26105, 6349, '<td valign="top">this photo is dull and seems a bit crooked.  It needs more spice to it and it seems to have been taken from low to the ground for no reason (unless you''re a kid, then it''s understandable and your picture is pretty good!)</td>', 'this photo is dull and seems a bit crooked.  It needs more spice to it and it seems to have been taken from low to the ground for no reason (unless you''re a kid, then it''s understandable and your picture is pretty good!)', '2003-06-27 10:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
