(340350, 25686, 714, '<td valign="top">Nice picture but everything seems a bit tilted.  Maybe it isn''t..ya now that I look at it more it isn''t.  I think there must be a hill or slope under those trees making the appear tilted. The house on the right side seems a little washed out.  Maybe try shooting at a different part of the day.  This would also look good in sepia tone. Good luck.</td>', 'Nice picture but everything seems a bit tilted.  Maybe it isn''t..ya now that I look at it more it isn''t.  I think there must be a hill or slope under those trees making the appear tilted. The house on the right side seems a little washed out.  Maybe try shooting at a different part of the day.  This would also look good in sepia tone. Good luck.', '2003-06-27 11:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
