(340410, 26121, 5176, '<td valign="top">the best l''ve seen so far the horse and its saddle look almost like a painting and even though the colours are quite soft the positioning against the background gives the picture a very dramatic feel</td>', 'the best l''ve seen so far the horse and its saddle look almost like a painting and even though the colours are quite soft the positioning against the background gives the picture a very dramatic feel', '2003-06-27 12:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
