(340527, 26121, 4517, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, maybe a touch more contrast or saturation would have make it stand out more.</td>', 'Nice photo, maybe a touch more contrast or saturation would have make it stand out more.', '2003-06-27 13:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(340529, 26249, 4517, '<td valign="top">Nice use of trees for framing the shot.</td>', 'Nice use of trees for framing the shot.', '2003-06-27 13:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(340532, 25993, 4517, '<td valign="top">Great angle and focus from front to back . One of my favs this week. 10</td>', 'Great angle and focus from front to back . One of my favs this week. 10', '2003-06-27 14:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(340534, 26333, 4517, '<td valign="top">Sun to distracting. Maybe a closer shot of the lambs would have been better.</td>', 'Sun to distracting. Maybe a closer shot of the lambs would have been better.', '2003-06-27 14:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(340537, 26205, 674, '<td valign="top">I like the catchlight in the birds eye Also you have captured the birds wings in motion Good effort</td>', 'I like the catchlight in the birds eye Also you have captured the birds wings in motion Good effort', '2003-06-27 14:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(340539, 26210, 4517, '<td valign="top">Perfect colour, focus and light but maybe not the most interesting subject. Still i can`t knock it because it`s better than my entry. 9</td>', 'Perfect colour, focus and light but maybe not the most interesting subject. Still i can`t knock it because it`s better than my entry. 9', '2003-06-27 14:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(340540, 25532, 6870, '<td valign="top">The shapes and textures of the pineapple really pop wtih this high contrast.</td>', 'The shapes and textures of the pineapple really pop wtih this high contrast.', '2003-06-27 14:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(340544, 26222, 4517, '<td valign="top">Nice scene 8</td>', 'Nice scene 8', '2003-06-27 14:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(340545, 26249, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice proscenium! good tones and super point of view.</td>', 'Nice proscenium! good tones and super point of view.', '2003-06-27 14:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(340547, 26201, 674, '<td valign="top">An atmospheric environmental image which probably has the non farmers going Shame! The contrast is good and this image works very well in black and white. Well done</td>', 'An atmospheric environmental image which probably has the non farmers going Shame! The contrast is good and this image works very well in black and white. Well done', '2003-06-27 14:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(340548, 25435, 6870, '<td valign="top">Superb composition and "still life"</td>', 'Superb composition and "still life"', '2003-06-27 14:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(340549, 25650, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice patterns and wonderful tones and colors. Super  horizon placement!</td>', 'Nice patterns and wonderful tones and colors. Super  horizon placement!', '2003-06-27 14:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(340550, 25689, 4517, '<td valign="top">Very sharp and clear. Meets the challenge well. 8</td>', 'Very sharp and clear. Meets the challenge well. 8', '2003-06-27 14:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(340553, 25468, 6870, '<td valign="top">I love the pose here! Lighting is harsh in background, but what a great capture!</td>', 'I love the pose here! Lighting is harsh in background, but what a great capture!', '2003-06-27 14:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(340556, 25846, 6870, '<td valign="top">i like your point of view here, peeking over the stalks of grain.</td>', 'i like your point of view here, peeking over the stalks of grain.', '2003-06-27 14:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(340557, 26270, 674, '<td valign="top">Nice image but a little soft</td>', 'Nice image but a little soft', '2003-06-27 14:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(340559, 26288, 6870, '<td valign="top">Fill in flash works well in this case. Nice portrait.</td>', 'Fill in flash works well in this case. Nice portrait.', '2003-06-27 14:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(340563, 26031, 6870, '<td valign="top">i enjoy the close crop of t his photo. Very intimate.</td>', 'i enjoy the close crop of t his photo. Very intimate.', '2003-06-27 14:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(340569, 25993, 6870, '<td valign="top">Classic use of line and tone. Good work.</td>', 'Classic use of line and tone. Good work.', '2003-06-27 14:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(340570, 26098, 6870, '<td valign="top">I suppose it is a cliche, but you''ve managed to make it unique with your framing and composition.</td>', 'I suppose it is a cliche, but you''ve managed to make it unique with your framing and composition.', '2003-06-27 14:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(340571, 26331, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice composition! Lighting is a bit harsh.</td>', 'Nice composition! Lighting is a bit harsh.', '2003-06-27 14:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(340572, 26339, 9115, '<td valign="top">Good, strong colours and composition, but the photo would have more meaning for me if I could tell what the white article in the bottom left is.</td>', 'Good, strong colours and composition, but the photo would have more meaning for me if I could tell what the white article in the bottom left is.', '2003-06-27 14:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(340575, 26271, 6870, '<td valign="top">This is very unique composition with the hay in front of the horse, but I like it because it is unique and still works. It is almost like we are peeking around the hay into the world of the horse. Nice work!</td>', 'This is very unique composition with the hay in front of the horse, but I like it because it is unique and still works. It is almost like we are peeking around the hay into the world of the horse. Nice work!', '2003-06-27 14:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(340578, 26095, 6870, '<td valign="top">Excellent focus makes this shot really shine. Wonderful composition, too. 9</td>', 'Excellent focus makes this shot really shine. Wonderful composition, too. 9', '2003-06-27 14:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(340580, 26276, 6870, '<td valign="top">Good focus and nice colors/lighting for this still life.</td>', 'Good focus and nice colors/lighting for this still life.', '2003-06-27 14:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(340582, 26315, 6870, '<td valign="top">Colors are otherworldly. Wonderful composition!</td>', 'Colors are otherworldly. Wonderful composition!', '2003-06-27 14:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(340585, 26312, 6870, '<td valign="top">Wonderful tones and interesting composition. Top quality work here. 9</td>', 'Wonderful tones and interesting composition. Top quality work here. 9', '2003-06-27 14:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(340593, 26031, 208, '<td valign="top">I like the B&amp;W, but I would have cropped it tighter - the space on the right is distracting. Also, is there something funky with the bottom border?</td>', 'I like the B&W, but I would have cropped it tighter - the space on the right is distracting. Also, is there something funky with the bottom border?', '2003-06-27 14:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(340598, 25815, 6870, '<td valign="top">You capture a lot of fun here! I like how there is space in front of the girl--it kind of indicates that she has space to run. The pony''s rear end would be nice to include in the picture. Very nice work!</td>', 'You capture a lot of fun here! I like how there is space in front of the girl--it kind of indicates that she has space to run. The pony''s rear end would be nice to include in the picture. Very nice work!', '2003-06-27 14:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(340600, 25647, 6870, '<td valign="top">Fun shot. Not only do we get to seen an interesting bicycle, we also get to see a family relationship, even though we can''t see the sister''s face. Nice work!</td>', 'Fun shot. Not only do we get to seen an interesting bicycle, we also get to see a family relationship, even though we can''t see the sister''s face. Nice work!', '2003-06-27 14:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(340601, 25696, 6870, '<td valign="top">Heck with Country Life. This is Country CLUB life! Super composition and use of negative space! 10</td>', 'Heck with Country Life. This is Country CLUB life! Super composition and use of negative space! 10', '2003-06-27 14:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(340602, 26079, 6870, '<td valign="top">Wonderful tones and composition. Nicely done! 10</td>', 'Wonderful tones and composition. Nicely done! 10', '2003-06-27 14:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(340603, 26265, 6870, '<td valign="top">Magnificent tones! Composition is inspired, with the sky adding so much depth and interest to the shot. 9</td>', 'Magnificent tones! Composition is inspired, with the sky adding so much depth and interest to the shot. 9', '2003-06-27 14:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(340604, 25879, 6870, '<td valign="top">Super tones and lines! light is magnificent. 10</td>', 'Super tones and lines! light is magnificent. 10', '2003-06-27 14:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(340605, 26273, 6870, '<td valign="top">Super work, very evocative and engaging. contrasts are wonderful. the addition fo the droplet softens the whole image considerably. 10</td>', 'Super work, very evocative and engaging. contrasts are wonderful. the addition fo the droplet softens the whole image considerably. 10', '2003-06-27 14:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(340607, 25801, 208, '<td valign="top">Well conceived shot. I really like how the subject pops out against the background. Only nit-pick is the bright spot on the bridge on the right.</td>', 'Well conceived shot. I really like how the subject pops out against the background. Only nit-pick is the bright spot on the bridge on the right.', '2003-06-27 14:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(340611, 26095, 208, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Great choice of dimensions, especially keeping the water all the way to the left. The dark strip really helps to keep the eye on the bird.</td>', 'Beautiful. Great choice of dimensions, especially keeping the water all the way to the left. The dark strip really helps to keep the eye on the bird.', '2003-06-27 14:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(340613, 26063, 208, '<td valign="top">I''d like more light in the foreground, but this is a really nice shot. I''d also like someone to bury power lines so they wouldn''t be in all our photos. The sky is otherwise well done.</td>', 'I''d like more light in the foreground, but this is a really nice shot. I''d also like someone to bury power lines so they wouldn''t be in all our photos. The sky is otherwise well done.', '2003-06-27 14:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(340614, 25435, 8860, '<td valign="top">Sleepy ol'' town! What a great shot. [7]</td>', 'Sleepy ol'' town! What a great shot. [7]', '2003-06-27 14:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(340619, 25939, 5628, '<td valign="top">Very cute! nice DOF and lighting</td>', 'Very cute! nice DOF and lighting', '2003-06-27 14:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(340621, 26250, 8860, '<td valign="top">A sweet little pic. Very tranquil.</td>', 'A sweet little pic. Very tranquil.', '2003-06-27 14:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(340623, 26273, 208, '<td valign="top">Great photo. To nit-pick: maybe a wee bit more light on the wire so we get some detail. As is, the background is all blurry and the foreground is all silhouette, and that''s it.</td>', 'Great photo. To nit-pick: maybe a wee bit more light on the wire so we get some detail. As is, the background is all blurry and the foreground is all silhouette, and that''s it.', '2003-06-27 14:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(340627, 26327, 5628, '<td valign="top">Well taken shot, but not a very interesting subject. It doesn''t really say "country" to me.</td>', 'Well taken shot, but not a very interesting subject. It doesn''t really say "country" to me.', '2003-06-27 14:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(340630, 25815, 8860, '<td valign="top">This shot is nice but could have done with straightening up and a tighter crop on the sky. [6]</td>', 'This shot is nice but could have done with straightening up and a tighter crop on the sky. [6]', '2003-06-27 14:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(340634, 26001, 208, '<td valign="top">The part of the photo in the gap in the trees is gorgeous, but it''s completely overwhelmed by the left third.</td>', 'The part of the photo in the gap in the trees is gorgeous, but it''s completely overwhelmed by the left third.', '2003-06-27 14:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(340637, 26125, 8860, '<td valign="top">Line up another cocktail, I''m on my way!...</td>', 'Line up another cocktail, I''m on my way!...', '2003-06-27 14:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(340640, 26124, 9635, '<td valign="top">I realy love the ducks! Good luck</td>', 'I realy love the ducks! Good luck', '2003-06-27 14:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(340648, 26151, 8860, '<td valign="top">I may be ignorant here but what is the Country Life relevance? It''s an impressive subject you''ve taken and I''d just like to know! ;o]</td>', 'I may be ignorant here but what is the Country Life relevance? It''s an impressive subject you''ve taken and I''d just like to know! ;o]', '2003-06-27 14:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(340653, 26247, 8860, '<td valign="top">Focus is a bit soft, but a nice study.</td>', 'Focus is a bit soft, but a nice study.', '2003-06-27 15:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(340654, 26122, 208, '<td valign="top">I like the picture, but the title would fit better if the left tree weren''t there. Leaving the picture empty (except for the right tree) would feel like a longer (lonelier) walk home.</td>', 'I like the picture, but the title would fit better if the left tree weren''t there. Leaving the picture empty (except for the right tree) would feel like a longer (lonelier) walk home.', '2003-06-27 15:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(340656, 26200, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice macro.</td>', 'Nice macro.', '2003-06-27 15:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(340662, 26315, 208, '<td valign="top">Very cool. Love how the white pops out of all that green.</td>', 'Very cool. Love how the white pops out of all that green.', '2003-06-27 15:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(340663, 26201, 8860, '<td valign="top">Unusual scene, so stands out from the crowd - a good snap of reality. [8]</td>', 'Unusual scene, so stands out from the crowd - a good snap of reality. [8]', '2003-06-27 15:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(340664, 26326, 208, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, though the flower in the foreground is covering a bit of her face.</td>', 'Nice picture, though the flower in the foreground is covering a bit of her face.', '2003-06-27 15:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(340666, 26308, 8860, '<td valign="top">Could have been improved with a bit of flash on the foreground. Nice feeling of space, but the sky is a little noisy. [Is that the moon?]</td>', 'Could have been improved with a bit of flash on the foreground. Nice feeling of space, but the sky is a little noisy. [Is that the moon?]', '2003-06-27 15:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(340667, 26303, 9635, '<td valign="top">i love me,my chicken too!</td>', 'i love me,my chicken too!', '2003-06-27 15:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(340668, 25686, 8860, '<td valign="top">A bit skewed and lacks a more emphatic focal point.</td>', 'A bit skewed and lacks a more emphatic focal point.', '2003-06-27 15:08:12.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(340669, 26239, 208, '<td valign="top">I''d''ve cropped it a bit tighter on the right, but this is great. He really stands out nice and sharp from the white background. Well done.</td>', 'I''d''ve cropped it a bit tighter on the right, but this is great. He really stands out nice and sharp from the white background. Well done.', '2003-06-27 15:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(340670, 26281, 8860, '<td valign="top">Colours are bit heavy on the blue/green.</td>', 'Colours are bit heavy on the blue/green.', '2003-06-27 15:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(340672, 25647, 8860, '<td valign="top">A nice study. [6]</td>', 'A nice study. [6]', '2003-06-27 15:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(340673, 25696, 208, '<td valign="top">Nicely framed. Really like the way the sky gradually lightens.</td>', 'Nicely framed. Really like the way the sky gradually lightens.', '2003-06-27 15:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(340674, 26249, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed shot. I''ve watched this for 15 hours now and still nothing''s happened!  ;o]   [7]</td>', 'Nicely composed shot. I''ve watched this for 15 hours now and still nothing''s happened!  ;o]   [7]', '2003-06-27 15:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(340675, 25939, 8860, '<td valign="top">This is the one!! It would have been 10 but your focus and contrast is a bit shoddy.  [9]  ;o]</td>', 'This is the one!! It would have been 10 but your focus and contrast is a bit shoddy.  [9]  ;o]', '2003-06-27 15:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(340678, 26090, 5082, '<td valign="top">Pretty shot, love the spectrum of textures and colors... the shot appears to lean too much to the right, though, the mountains on the horizon are close, but the rows of corn definitely make the shot "lean". - 6</td>', 'Pretty shot, love the spectrum of textures and colors... the shot appears to lean too much to the right, though, the mountains on the horizon are close, but the rows of corn definitely make the shot "lean". - 6', '2003-06-27 15:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(340680, 26011, 9439, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors and layout</td>', 'Very nice colors and layout', '2003-06-27 15:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(340681, 26207, 5082, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, this one needs to be rotated a shade CCW to look "right".  Our eyes expect pendulums to be up and down, and the tire hanging in the center of the picture clearly is off.  The rope should be hanging straight down, as it would in real life.</td>', 'Nice shot, this one needs to be rotated a shade CCW to look "right".  Our eyes expect pendulums to be up and down, and the tire hanging in the center of the picture clearly is off.  The rope should be hanging straight down, as it would in real life.', '2003-06-27 15:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(340683, 26150, 5082, '<td valign="top">Great twist on the subject theme.</td>', 'Great twist on the subject theme.', '2003-06-27 15:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(340684, 25801, 3697, '<td valign="top">I really like it! The sepia tone is perfect, and your idea is very unique and interesting. Great composition and lighting, very well done.</td>', 'I really like it! The sepia tone is perfect, and your idea is very unique and interesting. Great composition and lighting, very well done.', '2003-06-27 15:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(340685, 26029, 9115, '<td valign="top">This photo has a good overall colour and feel, but lacks a bit of interest (maybe in the foreground).  It may be better cropped closer to the gate which is the main subject, and would give the lovely, sunny greens nearer the top of the photo more prominence.</td>', 'This photo has a good overall colour and feel, but lacks a bit of interest (maybe in the foreground).  It may be better cropped closer to the gate which is the main subject, and would give the lovely, sunny greens nearer the top of the photo more prominence.', '2003-06-27 15:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(340690, 26266, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great clarity, character and composition. [7]</td>', 'Great clarity, character and composition. [7]', '2003-06-27 15:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(340695, 26095, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. Is this near your home?! [8]</td>', 'Nice capture. Is this near your home?! [8]', '2003-06-27 15:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(340697, 25938, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice lawn!! [6]</td>', 'Nice lawn!! [6]', '2003-06-27 15:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(340699, 25357, 8860, '<td valign="top">Border is unnecessary. Good cropping, and nice stances. Brighter sunlight would have been nice. [6]</td>', 'Border is unnecessary. Good cropping, and nice stances. Brighter sunlight would have been nice. [6]', '2003-06-27 16:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(340702, 25494, 8860, '<td valign="top">Poor lighting lets this down a bit. [5]</td>', 'Poor lighting lets this down a bit. [5]', '2003-06-27 16:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(340705, 25847, 8860, '<td valign="top">A bit skewed and too soft focus.</td>', 'A bit skewed and too soft focus.', '2003-06-27 16:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(340706, 26079, 7436, '<td valign="top">I wasn''t really thrilled with most of the entries in this challenge.  But I thought this one was practically postcard.  That''s a good thing.  I like your use of thirds.  The body is on the line and the head and feet are right in the sweet spots.  Perfect.  I also liked the duotone feel of it all.</td>', 'I wasn''t really thrilled with most of the entries in this challenge.  But I thought this one was practically postcard.  That''s a good thing.  I like your use of thirds.  The body is on the line and the head and feet are right in the sweet spots.  Perfect.  I also liked the duotone feel of it all.', '2003-06-27 16:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(340707, 26259, 8860, '<td valign="top">Shame about the wires. Lighting could be better.</td>', 'Shame about the wires. Lighting could be better.', '2003-06-27 16:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(340710, 26305, 8860, '<td valign="top">The deer looking away deflects interest in this composition. If it had been further left with more space to the right (and no artificial objects in view) it would have delivered a feeling of expectance or alertness. [5]</td>', 'The deer looking away deflects interest in this composition. If it had been further left with more space to the right (and no artificial objects in view) it would have delivered a feeling of expectance or alertness. [5]', '2003-06-27 16:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(340711, 26098, 7436, '<td valign="top">In this challenge with so many hideous borders, I was happy to see yours with a natural border.  No.. I was ecstatic!  The contrast is excellent and the feel of it being a slight bit off-center works horribly well.  One of my two favorite in the challenge.</td>', 'In this challenge with so many hideous borders, I was happy to see yours with a natural border.  No.. I was ecstatic!  The contrast is excellent and the feel of it being a slight bit off-center works horribly well.  One of my two favorite in the challenge.', '2003-06-27 16:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(340712, 26175, 7436, '<td valign="top">Even though there is motion blur, I think it works.  This shot has more character than 99 percent of the entries.  I dig that.  Great job at capturing the moment.</td>', 'Even though there is motion blur, I think it works.  This shot has more character than 99 percent of the entries.  I dig that.  Great job at capturing the moment.', '2003-06-27 16:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(340714, 26287, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF and lovely light. [6]</td>', 'Nice DOF and lovely light. [6]', '2003-06-27 16:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(340715, 26332, 8860, '<td valign="top">DOF is a bit too narrow. [5]</td>', 'DOF is a bit too narrow. [5]', '2003-06-27 16:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(340716, 26211, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very nice viewpoint. Says a lot about country living. [6]</td>', 'Very nice viewpoint. Says a lot about country living. [6]', '2003-06-27 16:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(340720, 26105, 8860, '<td valign="top">Too soft and skewed.</td>', 'Too soft and skewed.', '2003-06-27 16:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(340721, 26270, 8860, '<td valign="top">Lighting''s a bit dull, but a great shot. [6]</td>', 'Lighting''s a bit dull, but a great shot. [6]', '2003-06-27 16:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(340724, 25600, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice quality shot.</td>', 'Nice quality shot.', '2003-06-27 16:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(340726, 26170, 8860, '<td valign="top">Dramatic.</td>', 'Dramatic.', '2003-06-27 16:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(340727, 26273, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very, very satisfying shot. Nice one. I would have cropped off the slight lens flare to the right though. [7]</td>', 'Very, very satisfying shot. Nice one. I would have cropped off the slight lens flare to the right though. [7]', '2003-06-27 16:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(340728, 25411, 8860, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2003-06-27 16:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(340729, 26212, 4517, '<td valign="top">Great country photo and border works very well. I must learn how to do this.8</td>', 'Great country photo and border works very well. I must learn how to do this.8', '2003-06-27 16:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(340730, 26255, 8860, '<td valign="top">The lighting and focus are just too poor on this. An earlier/later time of day would help to create more definition. Keep at it though! ;o]</td>', 'The lighting and focus are just too poor on this. An earlier/later time of day would help to create more definition. Keep at it though! ;o]', '2003-06-27 16:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(340731, 26205, 4517, '<td valign="top">Just about meets the challenge but the pole and red thing are very distracting.</td>', 'Just about meets the challenge but the pole and red thing are very distracting.', '2003-06-27 16:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(340732, 25826, 4517, '<td valign="top">Interesting view of the country. Good colour and clarity.7</td>', 'Interesting view of the country. Good colour and clarity.7', '2003-06-27 16:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(340734, 26308, 4517, '<td valign="top">Thats a big sky. Works quite well.</td>', 'Thats a big sky. Works quite well.', '2003-06-27 16:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(340737, 26013, 8860, '<td valign="top">This is great character - and I\''ve never seen one in this detail before. The comb[?] looks really tangible. Result - [8]</td>', 'This is great character - and I\''ve never seen one in this detail before. The comb[?] looks really tangible. Result - [8]', '2003-06-27 16:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(340739, 26135, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice one.</td>', 'Nice one.', '2003-06-27 16:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(340741, 26207, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast of lifestyle. Shame the lighting''s not better and pic is quite tilted to the right.</td>', 'Nice contrast of lifestyle. Shame the lighting''s not better and pic is quite tilted to the right.', '2003-06-27 16:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(340742, 25713, 8860, '<td valign="top">I love this. Great textures and lighting. This is my favourite - it makes me reflect on what the world is like so far away. [10]</td>', 'I love this. Great textures and lighting. This is my favourite - it makes me reflect on what the world is like so far away. [10]', '2003-06-27 16:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(340744, 25401, 8367, '<td valign="top">Nice color contrast. Very serene looking.</td>', 'Nice color contrast. Very serene looking.', '2003-06-27 16:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(340746, 25978, 8860, '<td valign="top">Fascinating shot. Crisp,clear - looks like snow. Just unique. I''ve been experimenting with infrared too so this is an inspiration. [10]</td>', 'Fascinating shot. Crisp,clear - looks like snow. Just unique. I''ve been experimenting with infrared too so this is an inspiration. [10]', '2003-06-27 16:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(340747, 26266, 7436, '<td valign="top">A very cool picture.  A little hot in some spots, but I imagine that is necessary to get the great detail in the machine.  Nice shapes and flow.  Well done.</td>', 'A very cool picture.  A little hot in some spots, but I imagine that is necessary to get the great detail in the machine.  Nice shapes and flow.  Well done.', '2003-06-27 16:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(340749, 26132, 8860, '<td valign="top">Small, but perfectly formed! This could have been improved by moving the point of interest off-centre giving the feeling of space. This would create a more directional lens flare and stop the pic looking too centre-aligned (sun, boy, boy).</td>', 'Small, but perfectly formed! This could have been improved by moving the point of interest off-centre giving the feeling of space. This would create a more directional lens flare and stop the pic looking too centre-aligned (sun, boy, boy).', '2003-06-27 17:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(340752, 25959, 8860, '<td valign="top">Good capture!</td>', 'Good capture!', '2003-06-27 17:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(340753, 25801, 7436, '<td valign="top">A very nice shot.  I''m not sure if I like the border.  It almost makes it a little too "dreamy."  But I won''t take off for that.  I think the picture would have been stronger without the border though.  Aside from that, the shot has a good balance and nice shapes.  Good job.</td>', 'A very nice shot.  I''m not sure if I like the border.  It almost makes it a little too "dreamy."  But I won''t take off for that.  I think the picture would have been stronger without the border though.  Aside from that, the shot has a good balance and nice shapes.  Good job.', '2003-06-27 17:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(340756, 26198, 7436, '<td valign="top">I really don''t like this border. But I won''t take off too much for it.  The shot, however, I like very much.  It looks so happy.  Way to capture the moment.</td>', 'I really don''t like this border. But I won''t take off too much for it.  The shot, however, I like very much.  It looks so happy.  Way to capture the moment.', '2003-06-27 17:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(340757, 26104, 7436, '<td valign="top">I give you bonus points for being able to capture this moment.  Excellent.  The shot, however, is only a decent shot.  Not quite vivid enough.  I guess that ties in with the fact that it''s a little dark all over... just a touch.</td>', 'I give you bonus points for being able to capture this moment.  Excellent.  The shot, however, is only a decent shot.  Not quite vivid enough.  I guess that ties in with the fact that it''s a little dark all over... just a touch.', '2003-06-27 17:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(340758, 26213, 8860, '<td valign="top">Love it. There are two good chickens in this challenge! [7]</td>', 'Love it. There are two good chickens in this challenge! [7]', '2003-06-27 17:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(340759, 25648, 7436, '<td valign="top">Excellent color.  You can feel the layers of atmosphere.  I like this picture a lot.  And the windmill is a perfect little shape.  I''m not absolutely positive about the proportions.  I think I like them.  I keep looking at the shot though.. so I must like it.</td>', 'Excellent color.  You can feel the layers of atmosphere.  I like this picture a lot.  And the windmill is a perfect little shape.  I''m not absolutely positive about the proportions.  I think I like them.  I keep looking at the shot though.. so I must like it.', '2003-06-27 17:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(340761, 26213, 7436, '<td valign="top">I like this more than the other one.  Great angle.  Good color.  The background isn''t distracting, but gives hints of country.  Very well done.</td>', 'I like this more than the other one.  Great angle.  Good color.  The background isn''t distracting, but gives hints of country.  Very well done.', '2003-06-27 17:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(340762, 26213, 6025, '<td valign="top">The sharpness is incredible, and the bales of hay and the tractor add to it a lot. Cool. (10)</td>', 'The sharpness is incredible, and the bales of hay and the tractor add to it a lot. Cool. (10)', '2003-06-27 17:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(340764, 26112, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very tranquil.</td>', 'Very tranquil.', '2003-06-27 17:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(340765, 26071, 7436, '<td valign="top">The size of the border is the only thing I didn''t like about this shot, but I didn''t take off much for it, because the shot is really nice.  The color might be a tiny bit too pink, but it works because it''s a little girl (I hope that''s a girl).  Good proportions and feel.  Eye direction is a nice circle from the girl, then going left on the rocks, to the roof of the house, and then back again to the girl.  Very well done.</td>', 'The size of the border is the only thing I didn''t like about this shot, but I didn''t take off much for it, because the shot is really nice.  The color might be a tiny bit too pink, but it works because it''s a little girl (I hope that''s a girl).  Good proportions and feel.  Eye direction is a nice circle from the girl, then going left on the rocks, to the roof of the house, and then back again to the girl.  Very well done.', '2003-06-27 17:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(340766, 25978, 7436, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if I really like this shot or if I''m creeped out.  This was actually somewhere??  What a creepy cool place.  I like  your balance and use of shapes and negative space though.  It makes a good backwards "L" shape that your eye follows back and forth.  Well done.</td>', 'I''m not sure if I really like this shot or if I''m creeped out.  This was actually somewhere??  What a creepy cool place.  I like  your balance and use of shapes and negative space though.  It makes a good backwards "L" shape that your eye follows back and forth.  Well done.', '2003-06-27 17:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(340768, 25431, 8860, '<td valign="top">Don''t like hunting, hunters or their bloody trophies - but its''s a good shot! [6]</td>', 'Don''t like hunting, hunters or their bloody trophies - but its''s a good shot! [6]', '2003-06-27 17:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(340769, 26278, 4810, '<td valign="top">Great red colour in this picture</td>', 'Great red colour in this picture', '2003-06-27 17:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(340770, 26265, 7436, '<td valign="top">I really like the feel of this shot.  The use of space is great.  The menacing clouds overhead give it that "tornado coming to Kansas" feel.  And your border is tasteful and not distraction, like so many in this challenge.  Oh.. and it goes all the way to the edge.  I almost want to give you bonus points for that, but you don''t need them.</td>', 'I really like the feel of this shot.  The use of space is great.  The menacing clouds overhead give it that "tornado coming to Kansas" feel.  And your border is tasteful and not distraction, like so many in this challenge.  Oh.. and it goes all the way to the edge.  I almost want to give you bonus points for that, but you don''t need them.', '2003-06-27 17:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(340771, 26177, 7436, '<td valign="top">The only thing that hurt this picture, in my opinion, was the cars ont he road and the fact that there is no sky at all.  Pity you didn''t have a polarizing filter or maybe an ND filter.  Cool feeling to the shot.  A very great attempt.</td>', 'The only thing that hurt this picture, in my opinion, was the cars ont he road and the fact that there is no sky at all.  Pity you didn''t have a polarizing filter or maybe an ND filter.  Cool feeling to the shot.  A very great attempt.', '2003-06-27 17:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
