(340789, 25713, 7436, '<td valign="top">I like the color outside of the window.  The shack is great, too.  I think there might be a bit too much darkness around the window, though.  It creates a huge border, which is quite detracting... although it is better than almost all of the artificial borders in this challenge.  Good job.</td>', 'I like the color outside of the window.  The shack is great, too.  I think there might be a bit too much darkness around the window, though.  It creates a huge border, which is quite detracting... although it is better than almost all of the artificial borders in this challenge.  Good job.', '2003-06-27 17:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(340793, 26118, 7436, '<td valign="top">This picture is awesome for the colors alone.  Does it say, "Country Life?"  Not REALLY, but I won''t take off for that.  It''s still a great shot.  Good cropping.  Border isn''t necessary at all though.  Borders should be used to enhance shots.  This photo needs no enhancing.  Great job.</td>', 'This picture is awesome for the colors alone.  Does it say, "Country Life?"  Not REALLY, but I won''t take off for that.  It''s still a great shot.  Good cropping.  Border isn''t necessary at all though.  Borders should be used to enhance shots.  This photo needs no enhancing.  Great job.', '2003-06-27 17:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
