(340804, 25993, 7436, '<td valign="top">Great use of black and white.  Good detail and light.  Very nice angles and cropping.  Good contrast.  I like this photo a lot.  The only thing I don''t really care for is the border.  A border is used to make a shot look better.  This shot really really doesn''t need it.</td>', 'Great use of black and white.  Good detail and light.  Very nice angles and cropping.  Good contrast.  I like this photo a lot.  The only thing I don''t really care for is the border.  A border is used to make a shot look better.  This shot really really doesn''t need it.', '2003-06-27 17:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(340805, 25543, 4517, '<td valign="top">Good idea.</td>', 'Good idea.', '2003-06-27 17:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
