(340808, 26132, 7436, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  I wish it were a little bigger.  If only you could get a shot of only one boy... but with the sun looking exactly the way it does in this shot.  Hmm...</td>', 'I really like this shot.  I wish it were a little bigger.  If only you could get a shot of only one boy... but with the sun looking exactly the way it does in this shot.  Hmm...', '2003-06-27 17:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(340809, 25614, 7436, '<td valign="top">Personally, I like the dirty, dingy feel of the photograph.  It makes it feel less like Hawaii and more like country life.  All those other people are nerf-herders.</td>', 'Personally, I like the dirty, dingy feel of the photograph.  It makes it feel less like Hawaii and more like country life.  All those other people are nerf-herders.', '2003-06-27 17:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
