(340814, 26281, 7889, '<td valign="top">Good shot and i love the details on the petals, but i cannot see what it has to do with country life...</td>', 'Good shot and i love the details on the petals, but i cannot see what it has to do with country life...', '2003-06-27 17:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(340816, 25494, 7436, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  It full-on breaks a rule.  He has no space in front of his face... in fact.. he has a ton behind him.  I imagine you did that on purpose?  I think it works though.  I''m not sure.  It really creates a subconscious uncomfortable feel.  I wish the colors could be a bit more vivid and exposure a little more even.  But still a great shot.</td>', 'I really like this shot.  It full-on breaks a rule.  He has no space in front of his face... in fact.. he has a ton behind him.  I imagine you did that on purpose?  I think it works though.  I''m not sure.  It really creates a subconscious uncomfortable feel.  I wish the colors could be a bit more vivid and exposure a little more even.  But still a great shot.', '2003-06-27 17:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(340817, 25430, 4517, '<td valign="top">Nice sepia effect. Would look good hanging on a wall.9</td>', 'Nice sepia effect. Would look good hanging on a wall.9', '2003-06-27 17:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
