(340821, 26250, 7436, '<td valign="top">Except for those little blurry lights in the background off the horizon, I think this is a fantastic shot.  Oh.. and the border.  I''m really not fond of the border.  This shot really doesn''t need one - much stronger without it.  But I love the focus on one set of buds.  The colors in the sky go perfectly with the subject.  Really great shot.</td>', 'Except for those little blurry lights in the background off the horizon, I think this is a fantastic shot.  Oh.. and the border.  I''m really not fond of the border.  This shot really doesn''t need one - much stronger without it.  But I love the focus on one set of buds.  The colors in the sky go perfectly with the subject.  Really great shot.', '2003-06-27 17:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(340822, 25910, 7436, '<td valign="top">This is a textbook shot.  I was wondering when it would pop up.  Fortunately, I don''t think textbook shots are bad.  In fact, I think using that term means the shot is done how the shot SHOULD be done.  Great shot.</td>', 'This is a textbook shot.  I was wondering when it would pop up.  Fortunately, I don''t think textbook shots are bad.  In fact, I think using that term means the shot is done how the shot SHOULD be done.  Great shot.', '2003-06-27 17:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
