(340885, 26198, 8732, '<td valign="top">hehehee. I love it.  I have only given two 10s for this challenge, and this is one of them.  Nice texture for the pig/pig''s hair/mud on pig, I also like the DOF so that the background is slighty out of focus. What  I really like though is the composition. While I think the border is a little too big, I like how it really brings out the lines of the pig pen, and for once I really like the that two aren''t parallel. Good work.</td>', 'hehehee. I love it.  I have only given two 10s for this challenge, and this is one of them.  Nice texture for the pig/pig''s hair/mud on pig, I also like the DOF so that the background is slighty out of focus. What  I really like though is the composition. While I think the border is a little too big, I like how it really brings out the lines of the pig pen, and for once I really like the that two aren''t parallel. Good work.', '2003-06-27 19:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(340886, 26039, 8268, '<td valign="top">wow.. very interesting.. =)  but.  a little blurry on some petals</td>', 'wow.. very interesting.. =)  but.  a little blurry on some petals', '2003-06-27 19:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
