(340963, 26249, 8367, '<td valign="top">I like your title and framing. I bet this is beautiful in color.</td>', 'I like your title and framing. I bet this is beautiful in color.', '2003-06-27 21:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(340969, 26293, 7436, '<td valign="top">I don''t really like this double border thingee.  This could be a really powerful shot.  I would like to see it in color.  I bet that sky was awesome.  Good attempt.</td>', 'I don''t really like this double border thingee.  This could be a really powerful shot.  I would like to see it in color.  I bet that sky was awesome.  Good attempt.', '2003-06-27 21:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(340972, 26211, 7436, '<td valign="top">Really great detail.  I like this idea.  I''m not sure if this is the most efficient use of space or cropping, but I like the idea.  Good stuff.</td>', 'Really great detail.  I like this idea.  I''m not sure if this is the most efficient use of space or cropping, but I like the idea.  Good stuff.', '2003-06-27 21:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(340973, 26163, 7436, '<td valign="top">The color is just a little too bizarre.  Although it looks cool, I think it actually takes away from the picture.  The picture would probably have been really powerful in black and white.  Country life, I imagine, is a little more simple... lazy... plain.  This is almost too creative.  Good attempt.</td>', 'The color is just a little too bizarre.  Although it looks cool, I think it actually takes away from the picture.  The picture would probably have been really powerful in black and white.  Country life, I imagine, is a little more simple... lazy... plain.  This is almost too creative.  Good attempt.', '2003-06-27 21:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(340974, 25435, 7436, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.  I don''t know if it screams, "Country Life," but it certainly has that "lazy" feeling that goes with country life.  This actually has more of a magazine feel to me.  I guess you can take that as a compliment if you want.  Good attempt.</td>', 'I like this shot.  I don''t know if it screams, "Country Life," but it certainly has that "lazy" feeling that goes with country life.  This actually has more of a magazine feel to me.  I guess you can take that as a compliment if you want.  Good attempt.', '2003-06-27 21:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(340980, 26225, 7436, '<td valign="top">This is a really destracting border.  The shot is cropped well.  It could be a bit more vivid.  I would probably score this shot two points higher if not for the border.</td>', 'This is a really destracting border.  The shot is cropped well.  It could be a bit more vivid.  I would probably score this shot two points higher if not for the border.', '2003-06-27 22:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(340982, 26038, 7436, '<td valign="top">The shot is very nice, but the border hurts it, in my opinion.  Gives it a low quality post card feel.  Good attempt, though.</td>', 'The shot is very nice, but the border hurts it, in my opinion.  Gives it a low quality post card feel.  Good attempt, though.', '2003-06-27 22:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(340983, 26024, 1280, '<td valign="top">Interesting, off-beat perspective, incorporating a diagonal.</td>', 'Interesting, off-beat perspective, incorporating a diagonal.', '2003-06-27 22:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(340984, 26312, 7436, '<td valign="top">Border should be thinner.  The color and feel of the photo is good though.  I like it.  Too bad it has that border.</td>', 'Border should be thinner.  The color and feel of the photo is good though.  I like it.  Too bad it has that border.', '2003-06-27 22:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(340986, 25457, 7436, '<td valign="top">Good shapes.  I like it.  Good proportions.  Would be better if the sky liked you that day.</td>', 'Good shapes.  I like it.  Good proportions.  Would be better if the sky liked you that day.', '2003-06-27 22:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(340987, 25411, 4494, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2003-06-27 22:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(340999, 26260, 1280, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Sure is!  Nice image...lots of interesting texture, in the fence, sky, trees, and water with the reflection.  And the out building has quite some character to it.  Good job!</td>', 'Wow!  Sure is!  Nice image...lots of interesting texture, in the fence, sky, trees, and water with the reflection.  And the out building has quite some character to it.  Good job!', '2003-06-27 22:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(341001, 26334, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice, quiet solitude. Good color, and dof. Think it might be improved by moving the boat off-center somewhat. Still I like it.</td>', 'Nice, quiet solitude. Good color, and dof. Think it might be improved by moving the boat off-center somewhat. Still I like it.', '2003-06-27 22:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(341003, 26132, 4811, '<td valign="top">It looks like such a nice image, its a pity its so small. Hope you post a larger version when  the challenge is over...</td>', 'It looks like such a nice image, its a pity its so small. Hope you post a larger version when  the challenge is over...', '2003-06-27 22:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(341006, 25939, 1280, '<td valign="top">Good, fun picture.  Good dof, and comp works well.</td>', 'Good, fun picture.  Good dof, and comp works well.', '2003-06-27 22:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(341010, 25801, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a really neat photo... I love the ''laid back'' theme of rural life and living in the country.  The banjo adds a lot here for me as well.  I can almost hear the birds chirping and the babbling brook... the sounds that this photo seem to pronounce make it work nicely... excellent work :)</td>', 'This is a really neat photo... I love the ''laid back'' theme of rural life and living in the country.  The banjo adds a lot here for me as well.  I can almost hear the birds chirping and the babbling brook... the sounds that this photo seem to pronounce make it work nicely... excellent work :)', '2003-06-27 22:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(341025, 25590, 772, '<td valign="top">amazing shot... country life :)  A farmer milking his cow... the age of the man and the look on his face reveal a life of hard work, which is common in rural life.  Everyone works hard... pulls his own weight... provides for his family.. and smiles while doing it :)  I have had the opportunity to visit environments like this one in the past... this photo makes me remember the scent of the places... the mood... the sounds...  Kudos on a beautiful photo... = 10</td>', 'amazing shot... country life :)  A farmer milking his cow... the age of the man and the look on his face reveal a life of hard work, which is common in rural life.  Everyone works hard... pulls his own weight... provides for his family.. and smiles while doing it :)  I have had the opportunity to visit environments like this one in the past... this photo makes me remember the scent of the places... the mood... the sounds...  Kudos on a beautiful photo... = 10', '2003-06-27 22:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(341029, 26112, 5351, '<td valign="top">really pretty photo- I like the strong color of the grass even though it is sunset.  Nice job:)</td>', 'really pretty photo- I like the strong color of the grass even though it is sunset.  Nice job:)', '2003-06-27 23:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(341031, 25532, 1280, '<td valign="top">I like that you''re brave enough to try something different.  It''s a little busy, but I can still see two pineapples.</td>', 'I like that you''re brave enough to try something different.  It''s a little busy, but I can still see two pineapples.', '2003-06-27 23:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(341050, 26095, 9494, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Beautiful shot!  I love the color, the light and the focus.  The only thing wrong is that the photo doesn''t exactly fit the challenge.  Good job anyway.</td>', 'Wow!  Beautiful shot!  I love the color, the light and the focus.  The only thing wrong is that the photo doesn''t exactly fit the challenge.  Good job anyway.', '2003-06-27 23:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(341054, 26307, 6667, '<td valign="top">Golf course gang mowers?</td>', 'Golf course gang mowers?', '2003-06-27 23:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(341056, 26235, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice....the rocks are oe, but the perspective is nice and different, looking up at the cabin.  Reminds me of a place on the coast of Maine that I visited once.</td>', 'Nice....the rocks are oe, but the perspective is nice and different, looking up at the cabin.  Reminds me of a place on the coast of Maine that I visited once.', '2003-06-27 23:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(341058, 26263, 7229, '<td valign="top">Very nice, I bet it took a while to get it with the bird in there, or maybe it was just lucky timing? Anyway excellent photo!</td>', 'Very nice, I bet it took a while to get it with the bird in there, or maybe it was just lucky timing? Anyway excellent photo!', '2003-06-27 23:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
