(341095, 25959, 8953, '<td valign="top">I see someone may have challenged you. I dont see why myself. a lot going on but much to real to be staged. I think the flower in the back round works more for me...but with what you were trying to do the moment is what we have here. more depth of field would have made this pop.7</td>', 'I see someone may have challenged you. I dont see why myself. a lot going on but much to real to be staged. I think the flower in the back round works more for me...but with what you were trying to do the moment is what we have here. more depth of field would have made this pop.7', '2003-06-28 01:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
