(341188, 26308, 5892, '<td valign="top">I haven''t really commented much in this competition... alot of the stuff looks the same. But this one really caught my eye. At first I was going to tell you that it would be more effective if it were sharper at the bottom. But I decided that it''s great the way it is. It looks like a painting to me. And I feel as though I''m lying on my back in the grass, looking up at the sky. I love the moon (barely visible). The entire shot comes across as feeling dreamy, and reminds me of my childhood. Great job, and good luck this week.</td>', 'I haven''t really commented much in this competition... alot of the stuff looks the same. But this one really caught my eye. At first I was going to tell you that it would be more effective if it were sharper at the bottom. But I decided that it''s great the way it is. It looks like a painting to me. And I feel as though I''m lying on my back in the grass, looking up at the sky. I love the moon (barely visible). The entire shot comes across as feeling dreamy, and reminds me of my childhood. Great job, and good luck this week.', '2003-06-28 02:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
