(341424, 25935, 5822, '<td valign="top">Difficult exposure, but I think you did a good job, despite losing the detail in the water fall in the damn.  Good focus too... I just don''t find the subject all that interesting. This picture may have benefited by making it duotone.</td>', 'Difficult exposure, but I think you did a good job, despite losing the detail in the water fall in the damn.  Good focus too... I just don''t find the subject all that interesting. This picture may have benefited by making it duotone.', '2003-06-28 21:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(341425, 26303, 7304, '<td valign="top">This is what the country living is about. Old house with children running around with their friends,or in this case, a chicken.</td>', 'This is what the country living is about. Old house with children running around with their friends,or in this case, a chicken.', '2003-06-28 21:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(341426, 26013, 7304, '<td valign="top">This is an nice detailed shot. I love Macro shots and this chicken has his eye on you.</td>', 'This is an nice detailed shot. I love Macro shots and this chicken has his eye on you.', '2003-06-28 21:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(341429, 25713, 7304, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Has a very old fashioned feeling.</td>', 'Nice shot. Has a very old fashioned feeling.', '2003-06-28 21:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(341430, 25986, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the duotones here and the different and interesting geometric shapes made by this contraption. I would have liked to have seen a bit more contrast as it appears a little overexposed. I also like the border as it gives an additional feeling of antiquity and rustic feel.</td>', 'I like the duotones here and the different and interesting geometric shapes made by this contraption. I would have liked to have seen a bit more contrast as it appears a little overexposed. I also like the border as it gives an additional feeling of antiquity and rustic feel.', '2003-06-28 21:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(341431, 26135, 7304, '<td valign="top">Excellent. The marks in the middle where a vehicle has gone adds interest and kind of leads you to the red home/barn. The greens carry the load and have great definition.</td>', 'Excellent. The marks in the middle where a vehicle has gone adds interest and kind of leads you to the red home/barn. The greens carry the load and have great definition.', '2003-06-28 21:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(341432, 26273, 7304, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Up early on the farm after a rain.</td>', 'Nice shot. Up early on the farm after a rain.', '2003-06-28 21:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(341433, 25723, 7304, '<td valign="top">Amsel Adams would be proud.</td>', 'Amsel Adams would be proud.', '2003-06-28 21:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(341434, 26031, 7304, '<td valign="top">Sometimes you can''t break up two friends.</td>', 'Sometimes you can''t break up two friends.', '2003-06-28 21:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(341435, 26163, 7304, '<td valign="top">Nice old feeling.</td>', 'Nice old feeling.', '2003-06-28 21:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(341436, 25431, 5822, '<td valign="top">This photo has too abstract a feel to it as I''m not able to discern exactly what animal is represented here.  It would have worked better for me if you had zoomed in on one of the trophies and shown some detail so there would have been something more interesting to look at.  Coumpounding this is a drab background and the B&amp;W.</td>', 'This photo has too abstract a feel to it as I''m not able to discern exactly what animal is represented here.  It would have worked better for me if you had zoomed in on one of the trophies and shown some detail so there would have been something more interesting to look at.  Coumpounding this is a drab background and the B&W.', '2003-06-28 21:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(341437, 26116, 7304, '<td valign="top">That''s a yellow field.</td>', 'That''s a yellow field.', '2003-06-28 21:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(341438, 26336, 7304, '<td valign="top">Not done until you load them and store them in the barn for the winter. Hard work non the less. Good picture.</td>', 'Not done until you load them and store them in the barn for the winter. Hard work non the less. Good picture.', '2003-06-28 21:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(341439, 26272, 7304, '<td valign="top">Big licks on the farm. Fun shot and great color.</td>', 'Big licks on the farm. Fun shot and great color.', '2003-06-28 21:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(341440, 25814, 7304, '<td valign="top">Working hard. The red columbine adds interst to the otherwise dry photo.</td>', 'Working hard. The red columbine adds interst to the otherwise dry photo.', '2003-06-28 21:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(341441, 25850, 7304, '<td valign="top">Nice selection of roadway to lead you through the picture.</td>', 'Nice selection of roadway to lead you through the picture.', '2003-06-28 21:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(341442, 25816, 7304, '<td valign="top">Looks like fun.</td>', 'Looks like fun.', '2003-06-28 21:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
