(341530, 26070, 5822, '<td valign="top">Love the tones and think  you did a good job with exposure. Very clear and good focus. Only thing I don''t like is blown out and uninteresting sky.</td>', 'Love the tones and think  you did a good job with exposure. Very clear and good focus. Only thing I don''t like is blown out and uninteresting sky.', '2003-06-28 23:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
