(341610, 26015, 5822, '<td valign="top">This is an absolutely beautiful composition.  Though you''ve lost detail in the foreground weeds,  they frame the picture nicely. You''ve also captured a reposeful pose (lol) of the horse, which I like, as well as,  like the mysterious dark area in the upper right hand corner.  All very pleasing.  IMO, the weakest part of the picture is the soft focus and I wish there was a little more color to add interest. All in all, well done!</td>', 'This is an absolutely beautiful composition.  Though you''ve lost detail in the foreground weeds,  they frame the picture nicely. You''ve also captured a reposeful pose (lol) of the horse, which I like, as well as,  like the mysterious dark area in the upper right hand corner.  All very pleasing.  IMO, the weakest part of the picture is the soft focus and I wish there was a little more color to add interest. All in all, well done!', '2003-06-29 01:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
