(341775, 26315, 8171, '<td valign="top">Incredible image.  Fresh and unique with amazing contrasting colours - I can imagine this fading from a row of white tombstones in France for a ww2 homecoming movie.  Well done and good luck for the ribbon - 10</td>', 'Incredible image.  Fresh and unique with amazing contrasting colours - I can imagine this fading from a row of white tombstones in France for a ww2 homecoming movie.  Well done and good luck for the ribbon - 10', '2003-06-29 12:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
