(341845, 26118, 4517, '<td valign="top">Silky smooth photo and certainly gets an 8 from me but it`s not the sort of photo that says country life to me. I think more of farms, tractors and cows. Had this been an insect macro challenge you would have got a 10.</td>', 'Silky smooth photo and certainly gets an 8 from me but it`s not the sort of photo that says country life to me. I think more of farms, tractors and cows. Had this been an insect macro challenge you would have got a 10.', '2003-06-29 15:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(341846, 26075, 6451, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  I really like the layout of the image and how you got the road alongside the field and the fence. This adds for a nice image and good variety.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice image.  I really like the layout of the image and how you got the road alongside the field and the fence. This adds for a nice image and good variety.  Good job.', '2003-06-29 15:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(341847, 26303, 6451, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  Good focus and capture of the image.  I also like the variety of colors and patterns in your image that display life in the country.  Good job.</td>', 'Very nice image.  Good focus and capture of the image.  I also like the variety of colors and patterns in your image that display life in the country.  Good job.', '2003-06-29 15:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(341849, 26270, 4517, '<td valign="top">Nice cat macro and get a 6 from me. Doesn`t quite show country life to me but also doesn`t fail the challenge.</td>', 'Nice cat macro and get a 6 from me. Doesn`t quite show country life to me but also doesn`t fail the challenge.', '2003-06-29 15:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(341850, 26209, 6451, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  Very good balance in the image.  I really like the image as well.  It is a very good example of a nice planned out image and meets the criteria for country life very well.  Good job.</td>', 'Very nice image.  Very good balance in the image.  I really like the image as well.  It is a very good example of a nice planned out image and meets the criteria for country life very well.  Good job.', '2003-06-29 15:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(341851, 26112, 6451, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  Good use of reflection on the water and lighting.  Good job.</td>', 'Very nice image.  Good use of reflection on the water and lighting.  Good job.', '2003-06-29 15:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(341852, 26207, 4517, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene and perfect colour. It wouldn`t have taken much effort to straighten up in photoshop or similar program. You will be marked down for this which is a shame.6</td>', 'Lovely scene and perfect colour. It wouldn`t have taken much effort to straighten up in photoshop or similar program. You will be marked down for this which is a shame.6', '2003-06-29 15:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(341853, 26172, 6451, '<td valign="top">Very nice image. Good use of color and layout of image is nice.  I really like how the wind helps to display the country life and make for a really good image.  Good job.</td>', 'Very nice image. Good use of color and layout of image is nice.  I really like how the wind helps to display the country life and make for a really good image.  Good job.', '2003-06-29 15:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(341855, 26143, 6451, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  Good job displaying the colors and planning the layout of the image.  This is a great photo for the concept of country life.  Good job.</td>', 'Very nice image.  Good job displaying the colors and planning the layout of the image.  This is a great photo for the concept of country life.  Good job.', '2003-06-29 15:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
