(341998, 26098, 1647, '<td valign="top">I like the use of the frame / window as a border - and I love the colour of the clouds behind the windmill.  It''s a shame the blue sky makes an appearance - all clouds would have looked good.</td>', 'I like the use of the frame / window as a border - and I love the colour of the clouds behind the windmill.  It''s a shame the blue sky makes an appearance - all clouds would have looked good.', '2003-06-29 23:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(342000, 26263, 1647, '<td valign="top">What a lovely peaceful shot.  The colours are great and the bird adds a focal point.  Technically the shot looks great - good sharpness, good colour.</td>', 'What a lovely peaceful shot.  The colours are great and the bird adds a focal point.  Technically the shot looks great - good sharpness, good colour.', '2003-06-29 23:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(342002, 26235, 1647, '<td valign="top">The house makes it look like this shot needs to be rotated clockwise slightly.</td>', 'The house makes it look like this shot needs to be rotated clockwise slightly.', '2003-06-29 23:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(342004, 26266, 1647, '<td valign="top">I love wierd mechanical items and you have done a wonderful job of capturing this.  Well done.</td>', 'I love wierd mechanical items and you have done a wonderful job of capturing this.  Well done.', '2003-06-29 23:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(342006, 25834, 1647, '<td valign="top">Great texture in the wood, and shallow depth of field works well although the top right corner looks very slightly blurred as a result.  Also, the over exposed section on top left is a little distracting.  The title is good.</td>', 'Great texture in the wood, and shallow depth of field works well although the top right corner looks very slightly blurred as a result.  Also, the over exposed section on top left is a little distracting.  The title is good.', '2003-06-29 23:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(342007, 26122, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - I love the composition, especially the tree on the left.</td>', 'Nice shot - I love the composition, especially the tree on the left.', '2003-06-29 23:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(342009, 26039, 1647, '<td valign="top">It''s a good macro shot, but it doesn''t tell me much about life in the country.</td>', 'It''s a good macro shot, but it doesn''t tell me much about life in the country.', '2003-06-29 23:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(342011, 26013, 1647, '<td valign="top">It''s a great shot.  Did you remove the colour from the background?  If so I think it may have been better left in - his beak disappears into the grey somewhat.  Focus and clarity is wonderful and that red is stunning.  Well done.</td>', 'It''s a great shot.  Did you remove the colour from the background?  If so I think it may have been better left in - his beak disappears into the grey somewhat.  Focus and clarity is wonderful and that red is stunning.  Well done.', '2003-06-29 23:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(342015, 26281, 1647, '<td valign="top">The flower has a surreal look to it almost.  Although it doesn''t say much about life in the country</td>', 'The flower has a surreal look to it almost.  Although it doesn''t say much about life in the country', '2003-06-29 23:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(342016, 25854, 1647, '<td valign="top">I love the colours and reflections.  Artifacts around the leaves (white speckles) are a little distracting but possibly unavoidable.  The silohuette effect is very good.</td>', 'I love the colours and reflections.  Artifacts around the leaves (white speckles) are a little distracting but possibly unavoidable.  The silohuette effect is very good.', '2003-06-29 23:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(342021, 26052, 1647, '<td valign="top">It probably would have been more effective if the barb wire was brighter and sharper.  It looks very blue - perhaps a white balance problem and a little soft.  Not knowing the camera though it''s difficult to say if you could have done this shot much better.</td>', 'It probably would have been more effective if the barb wire was brighter and sharper.  It looks very blue - perhaps a white balance problem and a little soft.  Not knowing the camera though it''s difficult to say if you could have done this shot much better.', '2003-06-29 23:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(342022, 26070, 7570, '<td valign="top">has the looks of a winner here. 8</td>', 'has the looks of a winner here. 8', '2003-06-29 23:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(342023, 26150, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - that''s some tripod you''ve got yourself!  I''m not convinced the white border is the most approriate for this shot though.  Seeing the different fields is quite effective.</td>', 'Nice shot - that''s some tripod you''ve got yourself!  I''m not convinced the white border is the most approriate for this shot though.  Seeing the different fields is quite effective.', '2003-06-29 23:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(342024, 26001, 7570, '<td valign="top">i like the mist in the center. gives the photo layers. 8</td>', 'i like the mist in the center. gives the photo layers. 8', '2003-06-29 23:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(342027, 26079, 7570, '<td valign="top">somehow the country-folk in the pic do not look natural enough. 7</td>', 'somehow the country-folk in the pic do not look natural enough. 7', '2003-06-29 23:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(342028, 26303, 7570, '<td valign="top">this photo is able to capture the love of this little girl towards her pet-friend. love those eyes. 9</td>', 'this photo is able to capture the love of this little girl towards her pet-friend. love those eyes. 9', '2003-06-30 00:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(342029, 25849, 7570, '<td valign="top">very nice snapshot of country-life bar. 9</td>', 'very nice snapshot of country-life bar. 9', '2003-06-30 00:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(342030, 26124, 7570, '<td valign="top">this photo captures a story. very good use of DOF here. One of my 10s this week.</td>', 'this photo captures a story. very good use of DOF here. One of my 10s this week.', '2003-06-30 00:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(342031, 25590, 7570, '<td valign="top">i''m not sure what i can leave as a comment. but i find the smile very pleasant and came from the heart here. 10</td>', 'i''m not sure what i can leave as a comment. but i find the smile very pleasant and came from the heart here. 10', '2003-06-30 00:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(342037, 25685, 6938, '<td valign="top">Well done with the focus on the moth and plant.</td>', 'Well done with the focus on the moth and plant.', '2003-06-30 00:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(342041, 25517, 6938, '<td valign="top">The green of the border is a bit bright.  I would have prefered some focus on the strawberries in the forground.  At the moment I''m drawn to the horizon between the field and the trees where there is nothing interesting to look at.  I like your idea.</td>', 'The green of the border is a bit bright.  I would have prefered some focus on the strawberries in the forground.  At the moment I''m drawn to the horizon between the field and the trees where there is nothing interesting to look at.  I like your idea.', '2003-06-30 00:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(342043, 26170, 6938, '<td valign="top">I think I would have cropped out the bottom bit of tree - compaired to the scene it has some strong lines from the branches which are distracting.  I like the distance you have captured and the way the river draws your imagination around the mountain.</td>', 'I think I would have cropped out the bottom bit of tree - compaired to the scene it has some strong lines from the branches which are distracting.  I like the distance you have captured and the way the river draws your imagination around the mountain.', '2003-06-30 00:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(342047, 26306, 6938, '<td valign="top">Perhaps if this was taken from the other side - I''m not likeing how their near sides are in shaddow.</td>', 'Perhaps if this was taken from the other side - I''m not likeing how their near sides are in shaddow.', '2003-06-30 00:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(342050, 26052, 6938, '<td valign="top">Pity that the wire isn''t in sharp focus. The lack of light also makes the scene rather dull for me.</td>', 'Pity that the wire isn''t in sharp focus. The lack of light also makes the scene rather dull for me.', '2003-06-30 00:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(342053, 25468, 8911, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely shot/idea for this challenge. I think if the focus were a touch sharper on the boy''s face (it looks like perhaps the branch beneath his feet, and his feet, got more focus than his face), and the background weren''t quite as bright (not sure how that could be achieved, except maybe fill-and-flash, and maybe not then), it would be stunning.</td>', 'This is a lovely shot/idea for this challenge. I think if the focus were a touch sharper on the boy''s face (it looks like perhaps the branch beneath his feet, and his feet, got more focus than his face), and the background weren''t quite as bright (not sure how that could be achieved, except maybe fill-and-flash, and maybe not then), it would be stunning.', '2003-06-30 00:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(342056, 26205, 8911, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I''m impressed hte bird obliged you by hovering almost in place - so rare that you can actually see a hummingbird''s feet clearly enough to tell what they are!<br/> <br/>Of course, you know that your title is an awful, awful pun. (Good for a giggle, that was.)</td>', 'Nice shot. I''m impressed hte bird obliged you by hovering almost in place - so rare that you can actually see a hummingbird''s feet clearly enough to tell what they are! Of course, you know that your title is an awful, awful pun. (Good for a giggle, that was.)', '2003-06-30 00:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(342057, 25494, 6938, '<td valign="top">I like the way you have used shadows here. The sloping horizon is a bit distracting, but I can see that the subject is pretty straight. Nice focus and detail.</td>', 'I like the way you have used shadows here. The sloping horizon is a bit distracting, but I can see that the subject is pretty straight. Nice focus and detail.', '2003-06-30 00:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(342059, 26213, 6938, '<td valign="top">Nice clear focus.  The background is a bit distracitng (can''t work out what''s going on). You have captured the bird very well.</td>', 'Nice clear focus.  The background is a bit distracitng (can''t work out what''s going on). You have captured the bird very well.', '2003-06-30 00:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(342061, 26064, 6938, '<td valign="top">Nice focus on the fabric.  Being the subject of the photo the fly is in a very bad position, and doesn''t draw my attention. (perhaps if it was on its side to focus on it''s folded legs?)</td>', 'Nice focus on the fabric.  Being the subject of the photo the fly is in a very bad position, and doesn''t draw my attention. (perhaps if it was on its side to focus on it''s folded legs?)', '2003-06-30 00:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(342104, 26013, 9232, '<td valign="top">Great color.  Nice framing</td>', 'Great color.  Nice framing', '2003-06-30 01:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(342112, 26278, 9232, '<td valign="top">Nice subject.<br/>Great separation of colors with the blue sky, red barn and green grass.  The building in the background seems anomalous.  I''d like to see this shot from other angles.  The black barn roof and the white trim/fence define color areas.  The shadow on the front corner of the barn dilutes the power of the distinct regions of color.  I think this might have worked with a shot from farther to the left and crop out the end of the barn with the shadow; thus yielding blue sky in the upper left, green (althouth not verdant) grass in the bottom left and the red barn at the right side of the picture.</td>', 'Nice subject.Great separation of colors with the blue sky, red barn and green grass.  The building in the background seems anomalous.  I''d like to see this shot from other angles.  The black barn roof and the white trim/fence define color areas.  The shadow on the front corner of the barn dilutes the power of the distinct regions of color.  I think this might have worked with a shot from farther to the left and crop out the end of the barn with the shadow; thus yielding blue sky in the upper left, green (althouth not verdant) grass in the bottom left and the red barn at the right side of the picture.', '2003-06-30 01:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(342123, 26207, 9232, '<td valign="top">This picture catches my attention.  My initial reaction when it loaded was "country summer?"  How so?<br/> <br/>Upon looking again, the mobile irrigation system in the background sets the rural tone.  Growing up in south and traveling to see family in south Georgia or vacationing in Florida I have often seen settings so close to this in the dry, hot southern Georgia peanut, cotton or soybean fields that this image evokes memories.  <br/>The tire swing in focus in the foreground threw me at the start but for anyone that''s endured a hot summer here in the south, the only thing missing from this photo is the gnats.<br/> <br/>Technically I would like the see it cropped a little smaller with a little less grass in the foreground but your composition and editing are very good.</td>', 'This picture catches my attention.  My initial reaction when it loaded was "country summer?"  How so? Upon looking again, the mobile irrigation system in the background sets the rural tone.  Growing up in south and traveling to see family in south Georgia or vacationing in Florida I have often seen settings so close to this in the dry, hot southern Georgia peanut, cotton or soybean fields that this image evokes memories.  The tire swing in focus in the foreground threw me at the start but for anyone that''s endured a hot summer here in the south, the only thing missing from this photo is the gnats. Technically I would like the see it cropped a little smaller with a little less grass in the foreground but your composition and editing are very good.', '2003-06-30 01:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(342133, 26198, 6900, '<td valign="top">Did you think this border was a good idea?</td>', 'Did you think this border was a good idea?', '2003-06-30 01:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(342136, 25814, 9232, '<td valign="top">Good subject and nice action with the dust. <br/> <br/>The green trees contend, in my mind, with the tan/brown grains in the foreground, the red tractor and the blue sky.  I think that if you could catch the tractor out in open ground so that the trees were not in the photo, you would concentrate your message more.  I also would like to see a shot from a lower perspective; perhaps just over the top of the wheat, showing the tractor as a looming entity in the picture.  Just some thoughts.  Overall, I like it.</td>', 'Good subject and nice action with the dust.  The green trees contend, in my mind, with the tan/brown grains in the foreground, the red tractor and the blue sky.  I think that if you could catch the tractor out in open ground so that the trees were not in the photo, you would concentrate your message more.  I also would like to see a shot from a lower perspective; perhaps just over the top of the wheat, showing the tractor as a looming entity in the picture.  Just some thoughts.  Overall, I like it.', '2003-06-30 01:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(342137, 25723, 6900, '<td valign="top">Did you think this was a good idea for a photograph?</td>', 'Did you think this was a good idea for a photograph?', '2003-06-30 01:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(342142, 26281, 6900, '<td valign="top">Unnatural.  Not really nice to look at.</td>', 'Unnatural.  Not really nice to look at.', '2003-06-30 01:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(342143, 26036, 7711, '<td valign="top">I love the detail on the fence and the lighting. Colours are also nice and bright.</td>', 'I love the detail on the fence and the lighting. Colours are also nice and bright.', '2003-06-30 01:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(342144, 26265, 6900, '<td valign="top">Love the pic. Hate the border.  Actually, hate all borders like this.  Nice horse, though.</td>', 'Love the pic. Hate the border.  Actually, hate all borders like this.  Nice horse, though.', '2003-06-30 01:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(342145, 25647, 9232, '<td valign="top">Good subject and composition.  I like the use of monochrome to dull the whole image; it makes the young boy''s face stand out as he looks at the camera.  His gaze in the middle of the photo is the soul of this picture.</td>', 'Good subject and composition.  I like the use of monochrome to dull the whole image; it makes the young boy''s face stand out as he looks at the camera.  His gaze in the middle of the photo is the soul of this picture.', '2003-06-30 01:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(342146, 25978, 6900, '<td valign="top">Ok...</td>', 'Ok...', '2003-06-30 01:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(342152, 25848, 6900, '<td valign="top">Poor focus, poor lighting.  Nice subject, I guess.</td>', 'Poor focus, poor lighting.  Nice subject, I guess.', '2003-06-30 01:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(342160, 26313, 9232, '<td valign="top">Good action.  I would prefer a more shallow depth of field so that the running horse is in sharper focus while the barn and horse in the background are less clear.  It looks like you shot this at a high ISO as the hooves/legs are frozen even while the tilt of the horse implies motion.<br/> <br/>Good subject and a good angle for showing musclature on the move.</td>', 'Good action.  I would prefer a more shallow depth of field so that the running horse is in sharper focus while the barn and horse in the background are less clear.  It looks like you shot this at a high ISO as the hooves/legs are frozen even while the tilt of the horse implies motion. Good subject and a good angle for showing musclature on the move.', '2003-06-30 01:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(342162, 26273, 6900, '<td valign="top">Crop the pink thing.  It''s annoying.  7</td>', 'Crop the pink thing.  It''s annoying.  7', '2003-06-30 01:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(342170, 26118, 9232, '<td valign="top">Fantastic image.<br/> <br/>Great subject and composition.  I just don''t think it has much to do with the challenge (Country Life) as it could be set in a botanical garden in a city.<br/> <br/>I''d love to see this picture blown up as this is a great shot of this subject.</td>', 'Fantastic image. Great subject and composition.  I just don''t think it has much to do with the challenge (Country Life) as it could be set in a botanical garden in a city. I''d love to see this picture blown up as this is a great shot of this subject.', '2003-06-30 01:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(342172, 25517, 6900, '<td valign="top">This border was a horrible idea.  It made a semi-green, nice lines shot into something ... anyways.  Border no.</td>', 'This border was a horrible idea.  It made a semi-green, nice lines shot into something ... anyways.  Border no.', '2003-06-30 01:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
