(342307, 25532, 6771, '<td valign="top">I would like this photo if it looked more like a photo and not from a copier.  It does look like there would be some interesting textures here though</td>', 'I would like this photo if it looked more like a photo and not from a copier.  It does look like there would be some interesting textures here though', '2003-06-30 04:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(342311, 25426, 6771, '<td valign="top">Good subject, but it appears tonally flat.  The bar on the right and other part of the gate on the left are a bit distracting.  Maybe taken from a bit farther back to show the gate.</td>', 'Good subject, but it appears tonally flat.  The bar on the right and other part of the gate on the left are a bit distracting.  Maybe taken from a bit farther back to show the gate.', '2003-06-30 04:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
