(342323, 26063, 6771, '<td valign="top">Wonderful view, but tonally flat.  Maybe mostly cuz of the large negative space.  the powerlines are distracting.  Like to see the exposure a bit shorter or the aperture closed down a bit more</td>', 'Wonderful view, but tonally flat.  Maybe mostly cuz of the large negative space.  the powerlines are distracting.  Like to see the exposure a bit shorter or the aperture closed down a bit more', '2003-06-30 04:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
