(343253, 26336, 8159, '<td valign="top">Good subject matter for the challenge... but looks over-sharpened to me; also the hills off the distance are a little too "flat" looking.</td>', 'Good subject matter for the challenge... but looks over-sharpened to me; also the hills off the distance are a little too "flat" looking.', '2003-06-30 23:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(343255, 25430, 8159, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. Definitely says "country", and all the flatland in the background makes it seem like there is nobody around for a LONG way. Would like to see the full-color version to see which one I like better.</td>', 'Nice photo. Definitely says "country", and all the flatland in the background makes it seem like there is nobody around for a LONG way. Would like to see the full-color version to see which one I like better.', '2003-06-30 23:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(343256, 26306, 3724, '<td valign="top">I love the wire spools the goats are standing on.......  very typical.......  they are such strange beasts......  I once had one for a summer......  mine used to stand on my picnic table.....  the milk is  good on cheerios, i prefered it very cold.</td>', 'I love the wire spools the goats are standing on.......  very typical.......  they are such strange beasts......  I once had one for a summer......  mine used to stand on my picnic table.....  the milk is  good on cheerios, i prefered it very cold.', '2003-06-30 23:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
