(343260, 25651, 8159, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject matter. Would have been really great if the loading ramp was actually in use! Unfortunately this shot seems underexposed and I''m not sure that the white border does anything for the photo.</td>', 'Interesting subject matter. Would have been really great if the loading ramp was actually in use! Unfortunately this shot seems underexposed and I''m not sure that the white border does anything for the photo.', '2003-06-30 23:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
