(343385, 26124, 9343, '<td valign="top">Nice pic and good choice of title too (very clever).</td>', 'Nice pic and good choice of title too (very clever).', '2003-07-01 07:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(343386, 25978, 9343, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture. Nice composition</td>', 'Very nice picture. Nice composition', '2003-07-01 07:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(343392, 26198, 4388, '<td valign="top">i think i would have like it better with the border on the outside of the photo, nice shot of the pig.</td>', 'i think i would have like it better with the border on the outside of the photo, nice shot of the pig.', '2003-07-01 07:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(343395, 26122, 4162, '<td valign="top">This is such a lovely view, and the path really draws the viewer into the picture. However, it looks over sharpened, especially on the leaves, which detracts from the softness of the view.</td>', 'This is such a lovely view, and the path really draws the viewer into the picture. However, it looks over sharpened, especially on the leaves, which detracts from the softness of the view.', '2003-07-01 08:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(343396, 25922, 4388, '<td valign="top">the image is so small it is difficult to see</td>', 'the image is so small it is difficult to see', '2003-07-01 08:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(343397, 26287, 4162, '<td valign="top">It`s a lovely view and the light is gorgeous. However, it looks slightly oversharpened, which has caused the zig-zaggy edges on the ducks.</td>', 'It`s a lovely view and the light is gorgeous. However, it looks slightly oversharpened, which has caused the zig-zaggy edges on the ducks.', '2003-07-01 08:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(343399, 26315, 4162, '<td valign="top">What fantastic colours, contrast and leading lines. Lovely picture and a touching title. GL</td>', 'What fantastic colours, contrast and leading lines. Lovely picture and a touching title. GL', '2003-07-01 08:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(343401, 25801, 4162, '<td valign="top">What a fantastic picture! Has got to be first place! Lovely toning and great border. Absolutely country life!  Love it!</td>', 'What a fantastic picture! Has got to be first place! Lovely toning and great border. Absolutely country life!  Love it!', '2003-07-01 08:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(343402, 25494, 4162, '<td valign="top">A lovely feel to this and the man is totally fitting for country life.  The only thing I  would change is to give the man more space on the left, as it is he is looking out of the picture instead of into it.</td>', 'A lovely feel to this and the man is totally fitting for country life.  The only thing I  would change is to give the man more space on the left, as it is he is looking out of the picture instead of into it.', '2003-07-01 08:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(343408, 26108, 9703, '<td valign="top">Great subject matter- probably worth some $ these days!<br/>Nice composition.</td>', 'Great subject matter- probably worth some $ these days!Nice composition.', '2003-07-01 08:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(343409, 26026, 9703, '<td valign="top">love the compostiion of thie photo! tells a story without words.<br/></td>', 'love the compostiion of thie photo! tells a story without words.', '2003-07-01 08:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(343410, 26212, 9703, '<td valign="top">nice shot- the bale in the foreground is very helpful in telling the story behind this photo nicely done!</td>', 'nice shot- the bale in the foreground is very helpful in telling the story behind this photo nicely done!', '2003-07-01 08:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(343423, 26075, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the leading lines of the fence and road as they lead the eye towards the door of the house. Composition is good, however, I don''t find the subject all that interesting and there is nothing else in the image that stands out enough to make it more interesting. Perhaps cropping out the left side of the photo and moving your view so that the house is more left of center and showing more of the field and tree on the right would have improved it...I don''t know.</td>', 'I like the leading lines of the fence and road as they lead the eye towards the door of the house. Composition is good, however, I don''t find the subject all that interesting and there is nothing else in the image that stands out enough to make it more interesting. Perhaps cropping out the left side of the photo and moving your view so that the house is more left of center and showing more of the field and tree on the right would have improved it...I don''t know.', '2003-07-01 09:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(343425, 25337, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the wide angle view here and the colors are vivid, although a bit over saturated for my tastes. Nice pastoral and peaceful feeling.  Sky could use some more interest.</td>', 'I like the wide angle view here and the colors are vivid, although a bit over saturated for my tastes. Nice pastoral and peaceful feeling.  Sky could use some more interest.', '2003-07-01 09:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(343433, 25611, 5822, '<td valign="top">Composition is very interesting as I like the way the structures on the left and bottom frame the photo and also seperate the image into different square/rectangular shapes, kind of indicative of the shapes of different fields on a farm as viewed from above.  If this was your intention, good idea !   I do however find the duotone colors here weak and uninteresting, most likely due to lack overexposure and lack of contrast.  Focus is also soft and I''m not exactly sure what the main subject is here.</td>', 'Composition is very interesting as I like the way the structures on the left and bottom frame the photo and also seperate the image into different square/rectangular shapes, kind of indicative of the shapes of different fields on a farm as viewed from above.  If this was your intention, good idea !   I do however find the duotone colors here weak and uninteresting, most likely due to lack overexposure and lack of contrast.  Focus is also soft and I''m not exactly sure what the main subject is here.', '2003-07-01 09:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(343437, 26248, 5822, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo as you''ve really captured the textures and colors of the animal''s fur and straw very well.  Lighting very good and I like the way the engorged nipple is evident. Good job!</td>', 'Beautiful photo as you''ve really captured the textures and colors of the animal''s fur and straw very well.  Lighting very good and I like the way the engorged nipple is evident. Good job!', '2003-07-01 09:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(343440, 26235, 5822, '<td valign="top">Not sure what the subject is here...the house on top or the rock formation in the foreground. The rocks dominate the picture, but are overexposed, while the house shows more focus, but appears puny and obscured.</td>', 'Not sure what the subject is here...the house on top or the rock formation in the foreground. The rocks dominate the picture, but are overexposed, while the house shows more focus, but appears puny and obscured.', '2003-07-01 09:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(343446, 25479, 5822, '<td valign="top">Wonderful duotones here and excellent contrast! Composition is very interesting as well as I love the softness of the saddle as compared with the hard rock and wood in the background.  DOF is also very good and I like the way the background is only slightly blurred to help isolate the subject, but not enough to totally obscure it  Only the distraction in the lower left hand corner mars this photo, but not by much.  9</td>', 'Wonderful duotones here and excellent contrast! Composition is very interesting as well as I love the softness of the saddle as compared with the hard rock and wood in the background.  DOF is also very good and I like the way the background is only slightly blurred to help isolate the subject, but not enough to totally obscure it  Only the distraction in the lower left hand corner mars this photo, but not by much.  9', '2003-07-01 09:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(343453, 26247, 9757, '<td valign="top"><br/>.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-08-28 11:32:29.</i></td>', '.', '2003-07-01 09:55:41.000000', '2012-08-28 12:32:29.000000', 1),
(343458, 26270, 5822, '<td valign="top">Nice close up shot and good DOF but could use some more contrast.</td>', 'Nice close up shot and good DOF but could use some more contrast.', '2003-07-01 10:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(343461, 25805, 5822, '<td valign="top">Looks like a very nice shot, but I wish I could see a larger overall image to see the background detail better.</td>', 'Looks like a very nice shot, but I wish I could see a larger overall image to see the background detail better.', '2003-07-01 10:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(343468, 26288, 5822, '<td valign="top">I think a more effective shot would have been to crop out the bottom of the image right below the lower left sleeve.  The background subjects of the mountain and sky are very strong elements and I wish they were blurred more so as not to compete with the bride.</td>', 'I think a more effective shot would have been to crop out the bottom of the image right below the lower left sleeve.  The background subjects of the mountain and sky are very strong elements and I wish they were blurred more so as not to compete with the bride.', '2003-07-01 10:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(343471, 25337, 9759, '<td valign="top">Nice photo - I would have cropped out the stream, it too dead and lifeless</td>', 'Nice photo - I would have cropped out the stream, it too dead and lifeless', '2003-07-01 10:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(343492, 25854, 7040, '<td valign="top">Relaxing and inviting.  No need to say any more</td>', 'Relaxing and inviting.  No need to say any more', '2003-07-01 10:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
