(343554, 26118, 2764, '<td valign="top">As you already know, this picture is perfect.  If it doesn''t get two hundred 10s I will be surprised.  You have MASTERED the bug flower macro including the imprortance of choosing exactly the right flower and bug.  Plus I like how you have trained the dragonfly to face forwards and spread his wings. 10</td>', 'As you already know, this picture is perfect.  If it doesn''t get two hundred 10s I will be surprised.  You have MASTERED the bug flower macro including the imprortance of choosing exactly the right flower and bug.  Plus I like how you have trained the dragonfly to face forwards and spread his wings. 10', '2003-07-01 11:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
