(343737, 26123, 8811, '<td valign="top">yep, the atmosphere surely breathes the country life.</td>', 'yep, the atmosphere surely breathes the country life.', '2003-07-01 16:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(343738, 25401, 5313, '<td valign="top">I love it!</td>', 'I love it!', '2003-07-01 16:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(343739, 26222, 5313, '<td valign="top">Now, that''s just beautiful!</td>', 'Now, that''s just beautiful!', '2003-07-01 16:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(343741, 26038, 9772, '<td valign="top">The sun flare is used well.</td>', 'The sun flare is used well.', '2003-07-01 16:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(343784, 25956, 8159, '<td valign="top">The blown out highlights in the upper portion of the picture and the "insect protector" on the horse distract from the picture in my opinion. Lots of potential with this subject matter though!</td>', 'The blown out highlights in the upper portion of the picture and the "insect protector" on the horse distract from the picture in my opinion. Lots of potential with this subject matter though!', '2003-07-01 17:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(343786, 26090, 8159, '<td valign="top">A little too much foreground and background and not enough cows. :) I''m sure you were trying to make the picture interesting by including the flowers in the foreground, but I''m not sure it works in this case, given the challenge theme.</td>', 'A little too much foreground and background and not enough cows. :) I''m sure you were trying to make the picture interesting by including the flowers in the foreground, but I''m not sure it works in this case, given the challenge theme.', '2003-07-01 17:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(343791, 26011, 8159, '<td valign="top">Nice use of "tinting" to set the mood for this image.</td>', 'Nice use of "tinting" to set the mood for this image.', '2003-07-01 17:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(343793, 26269, 4514, '<td valign="top">This does not give that "Life in the Country" look but we all can not live in the country.</td>', 'This does not give that "Life in the Country" look but we all can not live in the country.', '2003-07-01 17:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(343795, 26122, 8159, '<td valign="top">Good subject matter for this challenge. It looks like it may be oversharpened, or maybe the image didn''t take kindly to be reduced to "web size". The whispy branches in the upper middle of the tree are just "dots" in many cases or have white halos around them, which detracts from the image.</td>', 'Good subject matter for this challenge. It looks like it may be oversharpened, or maybe the image didn''t take kindly to be reduced to "web size". The whispy branches in the upper middle of the tree are just "dots" in many cases or have white halos around them, which detracts from the image.', '2003-07-01 17:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(343797, 26302, 4514, '<td valign="top">This is an intresting shot.  Wondering what type of editing you did.</td>', 'This is an intresting shot.  Wondering what type of editing you did.', '2003-07-01 17:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(343799, 25360, 4514, '<td valign="top">And this depicts Country how???  I could see if maybe a Farm tractor was in there but It just looks like a three Car pileup. <br/></td>', 'And this depicts Country how???  I could see if maybe a Farm tractor was in there but It just looks like a three Car pileup. ', '2003-07-01 17:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(343803, 26256, 4514, '<td valign="top">Oh this is just Cute.  I would prefer greener grass but that is beyond your control.  I do like this shot but I think an angle closer to the ground would really steal the show.  Wonderful subject.  Gotta have a hoarse.  <br/> <br/>:-)</td>', 'Oh this is just Cute.  I would prefer greener grass but that is beyond your control.  I do like this shot but I think an angle closer to the ground would really steal the show.  Wonderful subject.  Gotta have a hoarse.   :-)', '2003-07-01 17:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(343805, 26095, 4514, '<td valign="top">I used to live in the Country and I do not recall a Water fall anywhere near any Farms.  This is a wonderful shot in the wrong challenge.  Need more Bird though.  <br/></td>', 'I used to live in the Country and I do not recall a Water fall anywhere near any Farms.  This is a wonderful shot in the wrong challenge.  Need more Bird though.  ', '2003-07-01 17:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(343806, 25586, 6378, '<td valign="top">It''s slightly tilted. Other than that it''s a great picture.</td>', 'It''s slightly tilted. Other than that it''s a great picture.', '2003-07-01 17:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(343807, 25337, 7291, '<td valign="top">I think the greens are a little over saturated but it still makes a nice example of Country Life.</td>', 'I think the greens are a little over saturated but it still makes a nice example of Country Life.', '2003-07-01 17:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(343808, 26198, 8159, '<td valign="top">Just my opinion, but I don''t care for the big border. Interesting picture of a pig though!</td>', 'Just my opinion, but I don''t care for the big border. Interesting picture of a pig though!', '2003-07-01 17:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(343809, 25451, 4514, '<td valign="top">You Talkin to me????  Cute Title.  You have fulfilled the Challenge.</td>', 'You Talkin to me????  Cute Title.  You have fulfilled the Challenge.', '2003-07-01 17:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(343810, 25517, 6378, '<td valign="top">I dont like the color of the border that you have chosen. It''s very distracting. A darker shade of green similar to the trees in the background would have worked well.</td>', 'I dont like the color of the border that you have chosen. It''s very distracting. A darker shade of green similar to the trees in the background would have worked well.', '2003-07-01 17:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(343811, 26012, 4514, '<td valign="top">Look at the cute kids walking in the "City"</td>', 'Look at the cute kids walking in the "City"', '2003-07-01 17:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(343817, 26210, 8159, '<td valign="top">Nice image! Nice big depth-of-field to keep the foreground and background objects in focus, which I think works well in this photo. The lighting wasn''t the greatest for the tractor from this angle though -- a little fill flash on your camera might have helped a lot in that regard. Overall though I like it.</td>', 'Nice image! Nice big depth-of-field to keep the foreground and background objects in focus, which I think works well in this photo. The lighting wasn''t the greatest for the tractor from this angle though -- a little fill flash on your camera might have helped a lot in that regard. Overall though I like it.', '2003-07-01 18:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(343839, 26079, 8159, '<td valign="top">Great capture. Love the feeling it gives the viewer. Glad you refrained from using a border -- works very well on its own.</td>', 'Great capture. Love the feeling it gives the viewer. Glad you refrained from using a border -- works very well on its own.', '2003-07-01 18:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(343842, 25831, 8159, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of JPEG artificats in the image -- I checked, and it is only 32K. This is far from the 150K maximum allowed by DPC. I think having a "crispier" image would have helped somewhat. Unfortunately, the power lines really detract from the "country" feeling. Keep shootin'' though!</td>', 'There are a lot of JPEG artificats in the image -- I checked, and it is only 32K. This is far from the 150K maximum allowed by DPC. I think having a "crispier" image would have helped somewhat. Unfortunately, the power lines really detract from the "country" feeling. Keep shootin'' though!', '2003-07-01 18:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(343844, 26105, 8159, '<td valign="top">First, potentially good subject matter for this challenge. Let me give a couple quick critiques that may help in the future. In a shot like this it is very important to have the horizon straight. The camera appears to be tilted toward the right. Second, the picture seems "soft". I''m not sure if this is a result of down-sizing for the web or not, but it is something to watch for. Finally, if there is any way to get the image to the maximum allowable DPC dimension (640), definitely try and do so! Keep shootin''!</td>', 'First, potentially good subject matter for this challenge. Let me give a couple quick critiques that may help in the future. In a shot like this it is very important to have the horizon straight. The camera appears to be tilted toward the right. Second, the picture seems "soft". I''m not sure if this is a result of down-sizing for the web or not, but it is something to watch for. Finally, if there is any way to get the image to the maximum allowable DPC dimension (640), definitely try and do so! Keep shootin''!', '2003-07-01 18:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(343846, 26061, 8127, '<td valign="top">oooh, love the contrast of this photo of stone and life and the mood. coool :o)</td>', 'oooh, love the contrast of this photo of stone and life and the mood. coool :o)', '2003-07-01 18:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(343847, 25337, 8127, '<td valign="top">the colours look over-saturated</td>', 'the colours look over-saturated', '2003-07-01 18:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(343848, 25850, 8159, '<td valign="top">Nice image. Would like to see it in color for comparison to your tinted version.</td>', 'Nice image. Would like to see it in color for comparison to your tinted version.', '2003-07-01 18:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(343849, 25896, 163081, '<td valign="top">very good shot ...</td>', 'very good shot ...', '2003-07-01 18:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(343850, 26104, 8159, '<td valign="top">Nice capture! Good detail and color. If only the horse was facing the other direction (head towards the camera) I think it would have made the image better than it already is.</td>', 'Nice capture! Good detail and color. If only the horse was facing the other direction (head towards the camera) I think it would have made the image better than it already is.', '2003-07-01 18:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(343851, 26224, 8159, '<td valign="top">Potentially good subject matter for this challenge. Unfortunately the picture seems over-sharpened; the trees don''t look as "natural" to me as they could.</td>', 'Potentially good subject matter for this challenge. Unfortunately the picture seems over-sharpened; the trees don''t look as "natural" to me as they could.', '2003-07-01 18:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(343852, 25479, 8159, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the saddle and the use of B&amp;W; the out-of-focus object in the lower left is distracting though.</td>', 'Nice capture of the saddle and the use of B&W; the out-of-focus object in the lower left is distracting though.', '2003-07-01 18:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(343853, 25451, 8159, '<td valign="top">Lots of potential -- wish the cows legs weren''t cut off!</td>', 'Lots of potential -- wish the cows legs weren''t cut off!', '2003-07-01 18:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(343860, 26098, 8159, '<td valign="top">Like this photo a lot; I think it had a lot of potential. Just wish the foreground wasn''t so underexposed to give some "detail" to the wood! Nice composition.</td>', 'Like this photo a lot; I think it had a lot of potential. Just wish the foreground wasn''t so underexposed to give some "detail" to the wood! Nice composition.', '2003-07-01 19:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(343861, 26215, 8159, '<td valign="top">The color cast in this photo is too yellow in my opinion. Other than that, this "corner" had lots of potential as a subject matter for this challenge.</td>', 'The color cast in this photo is too yellow in my opinion. Other than that, this "corner" had lots of potential as a subject matter for this challenge.', '2003-07-01 19:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(343862, 26110, 8159, '<td valign="top">The foreground lighting is just a little too dark in my opinion. A little fill-flash on the camera would have helped give some detail to the arbor and the fence that MIGHT have improved the composition.</td>', 'The foreground lighting is just a little too dark in my opinion. A little fill-flash on the camera would have helped give some detail to the arbor and the fence that MIGHT have improved the composition.', '2003-07-01 19:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(343865, 25910, 8159, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition! It looks over-sharpened to me though, and the "halo" between the horizon and the sky is very "unnatural" looking. Otherwise, nicely done.</td>', 'Interesting composition! It looks over-sharpened to me though, and the "halo" between the horizon and the sky is very "unnatural" looking. Otherwise, nicely done.', '2003-07-01 19:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(343866, 26205, 9652, '<td valign="top">Stunning!  Please make prints of this image available!<br/>To me, this bird is one of nature''s miracles! (and you caught him!)<br/>Excellent Work!</td>', 'Stunning!  Please make prints of this image available!To me, this bird is one of nature''s miracles! (and you caught him!)Excellent Work!', '2003-07-01 19:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
