(343922, 26061, 9462, '<td valign="top">Woh! that''s almost scary looking. Reminds me of something out of the Labyrinth.</td>', 'Woh! that''s almost scary looking. Reminds me of something out of the Labyrinth.', '2003-07-01 21:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(343923, 26177, 9652, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective...nice image!</td>', 'Interesting perspective...nice image!', '2003-07-01 21:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(343924, 25360, 9462, '<td valign="top">Ugh... did you submit the wrong pic or something? I see no sign of "country" anywhere. What is that in a mall?</td>', 'Ugh... did you submit the wrong pic or something? I see no sign of "country" anywhere. What is that in a mall?', '2003-07-01 21:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(343925, 25651, 9462, '<td valign="top">A bit too dark.</td>', 'A bit too dark.', '2003-07-01 21:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(343926, 26026, 9652, '<td valign="top">Excellent focus!</td>', 'Excellent focus!', '2003-07-01 21:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(343928, 25959, 8159, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the butterfly in flight... and the bee on the flower! But it just doesn''t say "Country Life" as well as some of the other photos.</td>', 'Nice capture of the butterfly in flight... and the bee on the flower! But it just doesn''t say "Country Life" as well as some of the other photos.', '2003-07-01 21:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(343929, 26102, 9462, '<td valign="top">Kinda drab... It''s really grainy and needs leveling.</td>', 'Kinda drab... It''s really grainy and needs leveling.', '2003-07-01 21:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(343930, 26031, 9462, '<td valign="top">Awww, so sweet!</td>', 'Awww, so sweet!', '2003-07-01 21:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(343933, 26281, 6349, '<td valign="top">This time it''s a mum that looks over edited.  No offense, but whatever color you dropped saturation on to make the flower pop out from the backround was present in the center of the flower, which is the focus of the shot, so it makes it look a bit overworked in my opinion.  I think it''s cool that the petals look like paper though.  Sorry, I''m not a big flower buff, I don''t know all kinds of flowers from others.  Just trying to be honest.</td>', 'This time it''s a mum that looks over edited.  No offense, but whatever color you dropped saturation on to make the flower pop out from the backround was present in the center of the flower, which is the focus of the shot, so it makes it look a bit overworked in my opinion.  I think it''s cool that the petals look like paper though.  Sorry, I''m not a big flower buff, I don''t know all kinds of flowers from others.  Just trying to be honest.', '2003-07-01 21:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(343934, 26265, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the tones very much and you''ve also acheived very good perspective between the horses and the background. The sky also adds interest, but I think that the upper third of the picture could have been cropped out without losing anything. Well done.</td>', 'I like the tones very much and you''ve also acheived very good perspective between the horses and the background. The sky also adds interest, but I think that the upper third of the picture could have been cropped out without losing anything. Well done.', '2003-07-01 21:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(343935, 26207, 8159, '<td valign="top">I like the imagery in this photo. Both play and work. A couple comments... if only the camera was level and not tilted to the right, it wouldn''t feel the picture is falling over. And it looks a little over-processed to me in the tree leaves... maybe it is just an artifact of the down-sizing for web display. Nice composition though.</td>', 'I like the imagery in this photo. Both play and work. A couple comments... if only the camera was level and not tilted to the right, it wouldn''t feel the picture is falling over. And it looks a little over-processed to me in the tree leaves... maybe it is just an artifact of the down-sizing for web display. Nice composition though.', '2003-07-01 21:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(343936, 25713, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors, and I like the frame within the frame concept, but I think you''ve focused on the wrong element in the picture.  The structure pictured within the window should be more focused less on the inside wall framing the main structure.</td>', 'Very nice colors, and I like the frame within the frame concept, but I think you''ve focused on the wrong element in the picture.  The structure pictured within the window should be more focused less on the inside wall framing the main structure.', '2003-07-01 21:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(343938, 25337, 3306, '<td valign="top">Normally, I don''t like oversaturated pictures but this one actually works. Gives a fantasy feeling to the picture.</td>', 'Normally, I don''t like oversaturated pictures but this one actually works. Gives a fantasy feeling to the picture.', '2003-07-01 21:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(343940, 26249, 8159, '<td valign="top">I love the composition in this photograph. The natural framing of the tree branches around the top and the wheat (?) along the bottom is terrific. I would have been very tempted to not even add an additional border...</td>', 'I love the composition in this photograph. The natural framing of the tree branches around the top and the wheat (?) along the bottom is terrific. I would have been very tempted to not even add an additional border...', '2003-07-01 21:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(343941, 25696, 3102, '<td valign="top">Definitely one of my favorites this week.  The coloring thanks to the fog is just awesome -- excellent work!</td>', 'Definitely one of my favorites this week.  The coloring thanks to the fog is just awesome -- excellent work!', '2003-07-01 22:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(343943, 26316, 9462, '<td valign="top">I don''t think you cruzin'' at your country club qualifies as "Country life"</td>', 'I don''t think you cruzin'' at your country club qualifies as "Country life"', '2003-07-01 22:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(343945, 25801, 9462, '<td valign="top">Nice, i just hope he doesn''t drop the banjo.</td>', 'Nice, i just hope he doesn''t drop the banjo.', '2003-07-01 22:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(343946, 26278, 3102, '<td valign="top">Love it!  There''s a barn not too far from here that reminds me of this one.  I''ve stopped a few times to shoot the one near us just because I love the vibrant reds in it, just like this one.</td>', 'Love it!  There''s a barn not too far from here that reminds me of this one.  I''ve stopped a few times to shoot the one near us just because I love the vibrant reds in it, just like this one.', '2003-07-01 22:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
