(344340, 25713, 6202, '<td valign="top">*Critique Club*<br/> <br/>It is me again, don''t you just love how busy I am?  <br/> <br/>The colors here are really good and the way the entire image is framed is very nicely done. Your focus and dof are very good.  I really don''t have much to say about how to improve it other than that white line of old paint in the window frame just seems so out of place, too bad you couldn''t have gotten rid of it.<br/> <br/>Again this is very good. Nice capture and definately a well done entry for the country life challenge.<br/> <br/>Anna</td>', '*Critique Club* It is me again, don''t you just love how busy I am?   The colors here are really good and the way the entire image is framed is very nicely done. Your focus and dof are very good.  I really don''t have much to say about how to improve it other than that white line of old paint in the window frame just seems so out of place, too bad you couldn''t have gotten rid of it. Again this is very good. Nice capture and definately a well done entry for the country life challenge. Anna', '2003-07-02 02:56:33.000000', NULL, 0),
