(344819, 26079, 3585, '<td valign="top">Great image! The only possible improvement at shooting time would have been to modifiy the hight at witch it was taken: have the boy''s whole head contrast with the sky or with the hills. I like the  fact that the leading line does not lead anywhere, it realy is the main subject''s leading line not ours as viewers. But if you look well enough, this young boy will take you for a long stroll along it; very dynnamic idea, and exausting...I think I''ll get a drink.</td>', 'Great image! The only possible improvement at shooting time would have been to modifiy the hight at witch it was taken: have the boy''s whole head contrast with the sky or with the hills. I like the  fact that the leading line does not lead anywhere, it realy is the main subject''s leading line not ours as viewers. But if you look well enough, this young boy will take you for a long stroll along it; very dynnamic idea, and exausting...I think I''ll get a drink.', '2003-07-02 09:08:21.000000', NULL, 0),
