(345793, 26098, 4967, '<td valign="top">I think this is one of my all time favorite photos ever on DPC... it is really beautiful, and definitely evokes thoughts of country OZ :-)  I spent 6 months on a farm in gatton, QLD.  Beautiful photo, just stunning!  Congrats!</td>', 'I think this is one of my all time favorite photos ever on DPC... it is really beautiful, and definitely evokes thoughts of country OZ :-)  I spent 6 months on a farm in gatton, QLD.  Beautiful photo, just stunning!  Congrats!', '2003-07-03 00:25:19.000000', NULL, 0),
