(346245, 25435, 6870, '<td valign="top">I wish I would have left lengthier comments below. This is certainly a strong image. Your sense of composition is very good. Just the way all of the elements fit together is so wonderful. I''ll be looking for more of your good work in the future, that''s for sure!</td>', 'I wish I would have left lengthier comments below. This is certainly a strong image. Your sense of composition is very good. Just the way all of the elements fit together is so wonderful. I''ll be looking for more of your good work in the future, that''s for sure!', '2003-07-03 15:04:22.000000', NULL, 0),
