(347499, 25815, 5112, '<td valign="top">Hi Lauren,<br/> <br/>This is a good shot!  You must be a natural.  The picture has so much feeling, it''s beautiful to look at, and makes me happy.  Is the horse''s name "Pippen"?  Reminds me of Lord of the Rings.  If it were my picture, one thing I might have done is straightening the horizon line (maybe, maybe not, sometimes I like them not straight).  Congratulations!<br/> <br/>~Ursula</td>', 'Hi Lauren, This is a good shot!  You must be a natural.  The picture has so much feeling, it''s beautiful to look at, and makes me happy.  Is the horse''s name "Pippen"?  Reminds me of Lord of the Rings.  If it were my picture, one thing I might have done is straightening the horizon line (maybe, maybe not, sometimes I like them not straight).  Congratulations! ~Ursula', '2003-07-05 13:26:24.000000', NULL, 0),
