(1192552, 26079, 33560, '<td valign="top">Wow!  That''s a great shot.  I love how the road winds its way through it, disappearing and reappearing in a different place. The young person is perfect.  Perfect placement, perfect ''costume'' perfect exposure.  As a newbie, I have to ask whether you used any special technique to keep the subject''s back from being underexposed - flash, dodging, etc.  Thanks.</td>', 'Wow!  That''s a great shot.  I love how the road winds its way through it, disappearing and reappearing in a different place. The young person is perfect.  Perfect placement, perfect ''costume'' perfect exposure.  As a newbie, I have to ask whether you used any special technique to keep the subject''s back from being underexposed - flash, dodging, etc.  Thanks.', '2005-02-24 11:02:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(1192742, 26079, 714, '<td valign="top">I didn''t do anything to it. This is pretty much a point and shoot camera that I took this shot with.<br/> <br/>Thanks!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-02-24 13:14:47.</i></td>', 'I didn''t do anything to it. This is pretty much a point and shoot camera that I took this shot with. Thanks!', '2005-02-24 13:14:31.000000', '2005-02-24 13:14:47.000000', 0),
