(2181985, 25401, 24073, '<td valign="top">befitting to my screen name, and fits well.  I can almost smell the grass, and the fresh air. I can almost hear the butterflies flapping their wings, and see the almost see the slow serine movement of the water.  This photo takes me there in almost every sense.  I just wanted you to know that.  Now on the critique of the technicals I couldn''t steer you one way to the other, but I can tell you it is very real even in the flaws if it has any.</td>', 'befitting to my screen name, and fits well.  I can almost smell the grass, and the fresh air. I can almost hear the butterflies flapping their wings, and see the almost see the slow serine movement of the water.  This photo takes me there in almost every sense.  I just wanted you to know that.  Now on the critique of the technicals I couldn''t steer you one way to the other, but I can tell you it is very real even in the flaws if it has any.', '2006-02-25 12:16:21.000000', NULL, 0),
